msgstr "Bezplatná zkušební verze"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: features details
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get your cloud-based Zammad here. No installation, no hassle, we take care of everything!"
msgstr "Získejte Zammad v cloudu. Žádná instalace, žádné starosti – o všechno se postaráme!"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: features title
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Zammad hosted services"
msgstr "Hostované služby Zammadu"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: features details
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can even self-host Zammad. Find installation instructions here."
msgstr "Zammad můžete provozovat i na vlastním serveru. Návod k instalaci najdete zde."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: features link
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "/en/get-started/installation/prerequisites"
msgstr "/cs/get-started/installation/prerequisites"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: features title
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Self hosting"
msgstr "Instalace na vlastním serveru"

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get Zammad"
msgstr "Získejte Zammad"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:24
msgid ""
"Not using Zammad yet? You will like it! Choose your favorite option below or "
"read on in the sections below."
msgstr ""
"Ještě Zammad nepoužíváte? Bude se vám líbit! Vyberte si oblíbenou možnost "
"níže nebo pokračujte ve čtení následujících sekcí."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:30
msgid ""
"If you have questions, feel free to [get in touch with us](https://"
"zammad.com/en/company/contact){target=_blank} and to have a look at the "
"[community forum](https://community.zammad.org/){target=_blank} were you can "
"find useful information and help."
msgstr ""
"Máte-li dotazy, neváhejte nás [kontaktovat](https://zammad.com/en/company/"
"contact){target=_blank} a podívat se na [komunitní fórum](https://"
"community.zammad.org/){target=_blank}, kde najdete užitečné informace a "
"pomoc."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Testing Zammad"
msgstr "Vyzkoušení Zammadu"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:39
msgid ""
"We are sure you like Zammad! The easiest way to test it is to use a [free "
"trial instance](https://zammad.com/en/getting-started){target=_blank}.  You "
"can play around and then you can switch to an official supported instance, "
"either keeping your data or start with an empty system."
msgstr ""
"Jsme si jisti, že se vám Zammad bude líbit! Nejjednodušší způsob, jak ho "
"vyzkoušet, je použít [bezplatnou zkušební instanci](https://zammad.com/en/"
"getting-started){target=_blank}. Můžete si v ní všechno vyzkoušet a poté "
"přejít na oficiálně podporovanou instanci – buď se zachováním svých dat, "
"nebo s prázdným systémem."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Zammad's hosted service"
msgstr "Využití hostované služby Zammadu"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:45
msgid ""
"To use Zammad in production, head over to our sister site [zammad.com]"
"(https://zammad.com/en/pricing){target=_blank} where you can find prices for "
"Zammad's hosted services."
msgstr ""
"Chcete-li Zammad používat v produkčním provozu, přejděte na náš sesterský "
"web [zammad.com](https://zammad.com/en/pricing){target=_blank}, kde najdete "
"ceny hostovaných služeb Zammadu."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Self hosted installation"
msgstr "Instalace na vlastním serveru"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:51
msgid ""
"You can even host Zammad on your own. Read our [installation instructions](/"
"en/get-started/installation/prerequisites) and see which deployment method "
"fits your needs."
msgstr ""
"Zammad můžete provozovat i sami. Přečtěte si náš [návod k instalaci](/cs/get-"
"started/installation/prerequisites) a zjistěte, který způsob nasazení "
"vyhovuje vašim potřebám."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:54
msgid ""
"If you are a self-hosted user and want to have support at hand, our sales "
"team is happy to get in touch with you. Just leave them [a message](https://"
"zammad.com/en/company/contact){target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"Pokud provozujete Zammad na vlastním serveru a chcete mít po ruce podporu, "
"náš obchodní tým se s vámi rád spojí. Stačí mu zanechat [zprávu](https://"
"zammad.com/en/company/contact){target=_blank}."

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:1
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Host upgrade and repository migration"
msgstr "Upgrade hostitelského systému a migrace repozitáře"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:9
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:9
#: src/en/get-started/installation/prerequisites.md:9
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:9
#: src/en/tutorials/connect-config-elasticsearch.md:9
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:9
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "<!--@include: @/en/modules/zammad-services-hint.md-->\n"
msgstr "<!--@include: @/en/modules/zammad-services-hint.md-->\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:13
msgid ""
"This page covers the required steps for a host upgrade and to switch to "
"Zammad's new package repositories. If you just want to update Zammad itself, "
"please refer to [Updating Zammad](update). To just switch to the new "
"repositories without a host upgrade, skip the host upgrade steps."
msgstr ""
"Tato stránka popisuje kroky potřebné k upgradu hostitelského systému a k "
"přechodu na nové repozitáře balíčků Zammadu. Pokud chcete aktualizovat jen "
"samotný Zammad, viz [Aktualizace Zammadu](update). Chcete-li pouze přejít na "
"nové repozitáře bez upgradu hostitelského systému, kroky upgradu přeskočte."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:17
msgid ""
"Zammad packages are being built with a new toolchain and are hosted under "
"another URL. The old toolchain is no longer in use, so the packages in the "
"old repositories no longer receive updates. This means you need to add a new "
"repository key and change your repository configuration."
msgstr ""
"Balíčky Zammadu se sestavují pomocí nové sady nástrojů a jsou hostovány na "
"jiné URL. Stará sada nástrojů se již nepoužívá, takže balíčky ve starých "
"repozitářích už nedostávají aktualizace. To znamená, že musíte přidat nový "
"klíč repozitáře a změnit konfiguraci repozitáře."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:20
msgid ""
"The repository channel in the URL selects the release line: `stable` "
"contains the current stable release, while release lines that are out of "
"support have a channel of their own, for example `stable-6.5`."
msgstr ""
"Kanál repozitáře v URL určuje řadu vydání: `stable` obsahuje aktuální "
"stabilní vydání, zatímco řady vydání, které už nejsou podporované, mají "
"vlastní kanál, například `stable-6.5`."

#. type: Fenced div block (warning)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Always make sure to have a [backup](/en/tutorials/backup-restore) of your data before performing an upgrade.\n"
msgstr "Před upgradem si vždy nejprve vytvořte [zálohu](/cs/tutorials/backup-restore) svých dat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "<!-- TODO: remove this warning box with the next Zammad release (added for the 6.5.5 emergency release). -->\n"
msgstr "<!-- TODO: remove this warning box with the next Zammad release (added for the 6.5.5 emergency release). -->\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (warning)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Zammad 6.5.5 is an emergency release that fixes a security issue. Zammad 6.5 is out of support and its packages are only\n"
"available in the `stable-6.5` channel. See [Update an out-of-support release](#update-an-out-of-support-release) below\n"
"for the steps.\n"
msgstr ""
"Zammad 6.5.5 je mimořádné vydání, které opravuje bezpečnostní chybu. Zammad 6.5 už není podporován a jeho balíčky jsou k dispozici\n"
"jen v kanálu `stable-6.5`. Postup najdete níže v části [Aktualizace nepodporovaného vydání](#aktualizace-nepodporovaneho-vydani).\n"

