#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform host upgrade"
msgstr "Provedení upgradu hostitelského systému"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:84
msgid ""
"Perform the host upgrade according to the documentation of your operating "
"system. Because this is an advanced task, we don't provide detailed steps "
"here. After upgrading your operating system, proceed with the next steps."
msgstr ""
"Proveďte upgrade hostitelského systému podle dokumentace svého operačního "
"systému. Protože jde o pokročilý úkon, podrobný postup zde neuvádíme. Po "
"upgradu operačního systému pokračujte dalšími kroky."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reboot host"
msgstr "Restart hostitele"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:90
msgid ""
"In case you did not reboot your system after the upgrade, make sure to "
"reboot your system now. Afterwards, check if everything is running as "
"expected. In case Zammad starts automatically, stop it again before "
"proceeding with the next steps."
msgstr ""
"Pokud jste po upgradu systém nerestartovali, restartujte ho nyní. Poté "
"zkontrolujte, zda vše běží podle očekávání. Pokud se Zammad spustí "
"automaticky, před pokračováním dalšími kroky ho znovu zastavte."

