#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:133
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove old repository key"
msgstr "Odebrání starého klíče repozitáře"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:137
msgid ""
"Remove the old repository key from your system. Depending on your operating "
"system and version, the location or method differs."
msgstr ""
"Odeberte ze systému starý klíč repozitáře. Umístění nebo postup se liší "
"podle operačního systému a jeho verze."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:138
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/keyrings/pkgr-zammad.gpg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/pkgr-zammad.gpg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"List the keys of your system:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"rpm -q gpg-pubkey --qf '%{name}-%{version}-%{release} --> %{summary}\\n'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Delete the key(s) related to Zammad (and only those!), replace `<key-name>` with the actual key ID:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rpm -e <key-name>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"List the keys of your system:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"rpm -q gpg-pubkey --qf '%{name}-%{version}-%{release} --> %{summary}\\n'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Delete the key(s) related to Zammad (and only those!), replace `<key-name>` with the actual key ID:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rpm -e <key-name>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/keyrings/pkgr-zammad.gpg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/pkgr-zammad.gpg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"Vypište klíče ve svém systému:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"rpm -q gpg-pubkey --qf '%{name}-%{version}-%{release} --> %{summary}\\n'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Smažte klíč(e) související se Zammadem (a pouze ty!), `<key-name>` nahraďte skutečným ID klíče:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rpm -e <key-name>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"Vypište klíče ve svém systému:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"rpm -q gpg-pubkey --qf '%{name}-%{version}-%{release} --> %{summary}\\n'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Smažte klíč(e) související se Zammadem (a pouze ty!), `<key-name>` nahraďte skutečným ID klíče:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rpm -e <key-name>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

