#, no-wrap
msgid "Update an out-of-support release"
msgstr "Aktualizace nepodporovaného vydání"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:398
msgid ""
"Zammad 6.5.5 is an emergency release that fixes a security issue. Zammad 6.5 "
"has been out of support for some time and no longer receives security "
"updates, so updating to the current stable release is the recommended "
"action. Follow the steps below only if you cannot update to a supported "
"release right now."
msgstr ""
"Zammad 6.5.5 je mimořádné vydání, které opravuje bezpečnostní chybu. Zammad "
"6.5 už nějakou dobu není podporován a nedostává bezpečnostní aktualizace, "
"proto doporučujeme aktualizovat na aktuální stabilní vydání. Následující "
"postup použijte, jen pokud teď nemůžete aktualizovat na podporované vydání."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:401
msgid ""
"Zammad builds 6.5.5 packages for Ubuntu 20.04, 22.04 and 24.04, Debian 11 "
"and 12, CentOS/RHEL 8 and 9, and OpenSUSE Leap/SLES 15."
msgstr ""
"Zammad sestavuje balíčky verze 6.5.5 pro Ubuntu 20.04, 22.04 a 24.04, Debian "
"11 a 12, CentOS/RHEL 8 a 9 a OpenSUSE Leap/SLES 15."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:402
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add the 6.5 repository"
msgstr "Přidání repozitáře 6.5"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:406
msgid ""
"Remove the old repository and its key first, as described in Adjust package "
"repository above. Otherwise your package manager keeps reading the old "
"repository, which offers packages of a newer release line."
msgstr ""
"Nejprve odeberte starý repozitář a jeho klíč, jak je popsáno výše v části "
"Úprava repozitáře balíčků. Jinak bude správce balíčků dál číst starý "
"repozitář, který nabízí balíčky novější řady vydání."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:408
msgid "Add the new repository with the `stable-6.5` channel:"
msgstr "Přidejte nový repozitář s kanálem `stable-6.5`:"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:409
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"Add repository key:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo curl -fsSL \"https://go.packager.io/srv/deb/zammad/zammad/gpg-key.gpg\" \\\n"
"  -o /usr/share/keyrings/zammad.gpg && sudo chmod 644 /usr/share/keyrings/zammad.gpg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Add repository (Ubuntu 20.04):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo curl -fsSL \"https://go.packager.io/srv/zammad/zammad/stable-6.5/installer/ubuntu/20.04.list\" \\\n"
"  -o /etc/apt/sources.list.d/zammad.list\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Add repository (Ubuntu 22.04):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo curl -fsSL \"https://go.packager.io/srv/zammad/zammad/stable-6.5/installer/ubuntu/22.04.list\" \\\n"
"  -o /etc/apt/sources.list.d/zammad.list\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Add repository (Ubuntu 24.04):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo curl -fsSL \"https://go.packager.io/srv/zammad/zammad/stable-6.5/installer/ubuntu/24.04.list\" \\\n"
"  -o /etc/apt/sources.list.d/zammad.list\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"Add repository key:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo curl -fsSL \"https://go.packager.io/srv/deb/zammad/zammad/gpg-key.gpg\" \\\n"
"  -o /usr/share/keyrings/zammad.gpg && sudo chmod 644 /usr/share/keyrings/zammad.gpg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Add repository (Debian 11):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo curl -fsSL \"https://go.packager.io/srv/zammad/zammad/stable-6.5/installer/debian/11.list\" \\\n"
"  -o /etc/apt/sources.list.d/zammad.list\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Add repository (Debian 12):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo curl -fsSL \"https://go.packager.io/srv/zammad/zammad/stable-6.5/installer/debian/12.list\" \\\n"
"  -o /etc/apt/sources.list.d/zammad.list\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"Add repository (OpenSUSE/SLES 15):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo curl -o /etc/zypp/repos.d/zammad.repo \\\n"
"  \"https://go.packager.io/srv/zammad/zammad/stable-6.5/installer/sles/15.repo\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"Add repository key:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rpm --import https://go.packager.io/srv/rpm/zammad/zammad/gpg-key.asc\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Add repository (CentOS/RHEL 8):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo curl -fsSL \"https://go.packager.io/srv/zammad/zammad/stable-6.5/installer/el/8.repo\" \\\n"
"  -o /etc/yum.repos.d/zammad.repo\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Add repository (CentOS/RHEL 9):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo curl -fsSL \"https://go.packager.io/srv/zammad/zammad/stable-6.5/installer/el/9.repo\" \\\n"
"  -o /etc/yum.repos.d/zammad.repo\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"Přidejte klíč repozitáře:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo curl -fsSL \"https://go.packager.io/srv/deb/zammad/zammad/gpg-key.gpg\" \\\n"
"  -o /usr/share/keyrings/zammad.gpg && sudo chmod 644 /usr/share/keyrings/zammad.gpg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
