"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"Přidejte repozitář (OpenSUSE/SLES 15):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo curl -o /etc/zypp/repos.d/zammad.repo \\\n"
