#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported operating systems"
msgstr "Podporované operační systémy"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:13
msgid ""
"For package installation, the following Linux distributions are supported:"
msgstr "Pro instalaci z balíčku jsou podporovány tyto distribuce Linuxu:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:24
msgid ""
"If your distribution is not supported, feel free to use a different "
"installation method or consider using [Zammad's cloud service](https://"
"zammad.com/en/pricing){target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"Pokud vaše distribuce není podporována, použijte jiný způsob instalace nebo "
"zvažte [cloudovou službu Zammadu](https://zammad.com/en/pricing)"
"{target=_blank}."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:27
msgid ""
"To follow the installation steps below, tools like curl, gnupg and others "
"are required. If they are not present on your system, install them:"
msgstr ""
"K provedení níže uvedených kroků instalace jsou potřeba nástroje jako curl, "
"gnupg a další. Pokud je ve svém systému nemáte, nainstalujte je:"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install curl apt-transport-https gnupg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install curl apt-transport-https gnupg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"OpenSUSE doesn't require any additional steps here!\n"
"\n"
"SLES 15 requires additional repositories to be activated. To do so, run the following commands.\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo SUSEConnect --product sle-module-desktop-applications/$(. /etc/os-release; echo $VERSION_ID)/$(uname -i)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo SUSEConnect --product PackageHub/$(. /etc/os-release; echo $VERSION_ID)/$(uname -i)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dnf install curl epel-release\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install curl apt-transport-https gnupg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install curl apt-transport-https gnupg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"OpenSUSE zde nevyžaduje žádné další kroky!\n"
"\n"
"SLES 15 vyžaduje aktivaci dalších repozitářů. Spusťte k tomu následující příkazy.\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo SUSEConnect --product sle-module-desktop-applications/$(. /etc/os-release; echo $VERSION_ID)/$(uname -i)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo SUSEConnect --product PackageHub/$(. /etc/os-release; echo $VERSION_ID)/$(uname -i)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dnf install curl epel-release\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:67
msgid ""
"Zammad uses [jemalloc](https://jemalloc.net/){target=_blank} as memory "
"allocator out of the box on Debian, Ubuntu, CentOS and RHEL. For SLES, opt-"
"out and verification details, see the [Memory allocator](/en/reference/"
"memory-allocator)  page."
msgstr ""
"Zammad v Debianu, Ubuntu, CentOS a RHEL standardně používá jako alokátor "
"paměti [jemalloc](https://jemalloc.net/){target=_blank}. Informace pro SLES, "
"k vypnutí a k ověření najdete na stránce [Alokátor paměti](/cs/reference/"
"memory-allocator)."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure correct locale"
msgstr "Zajištění správného nastavení locale"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:72
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"List your current locale settings:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"locale | grep \"LANG=\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"If above does not return `<lang_code>.utf8`, you can correct this\n"
"issue as follows:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install locales\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo locale-gen en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"echo \"LANG=en_US.UTF-8\" | sudo tee /etc/default/locale\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"After fixing it, make sure to check the output again for including\n"
"`<lang_code>.utf8`. A reboot may help if unsuccessful.\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"List your current locale settings:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"locale | grep \"LANG=\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"If above does not return `<lang_code>.utf8`, you can correct this\n"
"issue as follows:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install locales\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo locale-gen en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"echo \"LANG=en_US.UTF-8\" | sudo tee /etc/default/locale\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"After fixing it, make sure to check the output again for including\n"
"`<lang_code>.utf8`. A reboot may help if unsuccessful.\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"List your current locale settings:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"localectl status | grep LANG\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"If above does not return `<lang_code>.utf8`, you can correct this\n"
"issue as follows:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo localectl set-locale LANG=en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"After fixing it, make sure to check the output again for including\n"
"`<lang_code>.utf8`. A reboot may help if unsuccessful.\n"
"\n"
"===CentOS/RHEL\n"
"List your current locale settings:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"locale | grep \"LANG=\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"If above does not return `<lang_code>.utf8`, you can correct this\n"
"issue as follows:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo localectl set-locale LANG=en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"After fixing it, make sure to check the output again for including\n"
"`<lang_code>.utf8`. A reboot may help if unsuccessful.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"Vypište aktuální nastavení locale:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"locale | grep \"LANG=\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Pokud výše uvedený příkaz nevrátí `<lang_code>.utf8`, můžete tento\n"
"problém opravit takto:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install locales\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo locale-gen en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"echo \"LANG=en_US.UTF-8\" | sudo tee /etc/default/locale\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Po opravě znovu zkontrolujte, zda výstup obsahuje\n"
"`<lang_code>.utf8`. Pokud se to nepodaří, může pomoci restart.\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"Vypište aktuální nastavení locale:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"locale | grep \"LANG=\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Pokud výše uvedený příkaz nevrátí `<lang_code>.utf8`, můžete tento\n"
"problém opravit takto:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install locales\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo locale-gen en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"echo \"LANG=en_US.UTF-8\" | sudo tee /etc/default/locale\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Po opravě znovu zkontrolujte, zda výstup obsahuje\n"
"`<lang_code>.utf8`. Pokud se to nepodaří, může pomoci restart.\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"Vypište aktuální nastavení locale:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"localectl status | grep LANG\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Pokud výše uvedený příkaz nevrátí `<lang_code>.utf8`, můžete tento\n"
"problém opravit takto:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo localectl set-locale LANG=en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Po opravě znovu zkontrolujte, zda výstup obsahuje\n"
"`<lang_code>.utf8`. Pokud se to nepodaří, může pomoci restart.\n"
"\n"
"===CentOS/RHEL\n"
"Vypište aktuální nastavení locale:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"locale | grep \"LANG=\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Pokud výše uvedený příkaz nevrátí `<lang_code>.utf8`, můžete tento\n"
"problém opravit takto:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo localectl set-locale LANG=en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Po opravě znovu zkontrolujte, zda výstup obsahuje\n"
"`<lang_code>.utf8`. Pokud se to nepodaří, může pomoci restart.\n"
"\n"

