#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:314
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage services of Zammad"
msgstr "Správa služeb Zammadu"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:317
msgid ""
"Zammad uses three services. These services can be managed individually or "
"all at once by using the parent **zammad**."
msgstr ""
"Zammad používá tři služby. Tyto služby lze spravovat jednotlivě nebo všechny "
"najednou pomocí nadřazené služby **zammad**."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:322
msgid "zammad: includes the services below"
msgstr "zammad: zahrnuje níže uvedené služby"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:322
msgid ""
"**zammad-web**: internal puma server (relevant for displaying the web app)"
msgstr ""
"**zammad-web**: interní server Puma (zajišťuje zobrazení webové aplikace)"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:322
msgid ""
"**zammad-worker**: background worker - relevant for all delayed- and "
"background jobs"
msgstr ""
"**zammad-worker**: worker na pozadí – zajišťuje všechny odložené úlohy a "
"úlohy na pozadí"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:322
msgid "**zammad-websocket**: WebSocket server for session related information"
msgstr ""
"**zammad-websocket**: server WebSocket pro informace související s relacemi"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:324
msgid ""
"Manage the services with `systemctl`'s commands `start`, `restart`, `stop`, "
"`status`."
msgstr ""
"Služby spravujte pomocí příkazů nástroje `systemctl`: `start`, `restart`, "
"`stop`, `status`."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:326
msgid "Example to start Zammad with all sub-services:"
msgstr "Příklad spuštění Zammadu se všemi dílčími službami:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:332
msgid ""
"To stop or restart a service or to check its status, adjust the command as "
"mentioned above."
msgstr ""
"Chcete-li službu zastavit, restartovat nebo zkontrolovat její stav, upravte "
"příkaz podle výše uvedeného."

