#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:345
msgid ""
"Assuming a vanilla system, the following dependencies will automatically be "
"installed during the Zammad package installation. Additionally, you can find "
"some information about Elasticsearch below, which is not automatically "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"Na čistém systému se při instalaci balíčku Zammadu automaticky nainstalují "
"následující závislosti. Níže navíc najdete informace o Elasticsearch, který "
"se automaticky neinstaluje."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:351
msgid "imlib2"
msgstr "imlib2"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:351
