msgstr "Aktualizace"

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updating Zammad"
msgstr "Aktualizace Zammadu"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:14
msgid ""
"Before updating Zammad, we strongly recommend to take a look at our [release "
"notes](https://zammad.com/en/releases){target=_blank}. You can find "
"information about features, fixes and technical remarks and breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"Před aktualizací Zammadu důrazně doporučujeme přečíst si naše [poznámky k "
"vydání](https://zammad.com/en/releases){target=_blank}. Najdete v nich "
"informace o nových funkcích, opravách, technické poznámky a nekompatibilní "
"změny."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:19
msgid ""
"Be aware that you should not skip major Zammad versions while updating. That "
"means, for example, your upgrade path from version `2.4` to `5.1` (assuming "
"this is the current stable) would be: `2.4` → `3.0` → `4.0` → `5.0` → "
"`latest stable (5.1)`"
msgstr ""
"Při aktualizaci nepřeskakujte hlavní verze Zammadu. To znamená, že například "
"postup aktualizace z verze `2.4` na `5.1` (za předpokladu, že je to aktuální "
"stabilní verze) by byl: `2.4` → `3.0` → `4.0` → `5.0` → `latest stable (5.1)`"

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This page describes how to update Zammad only. In case you want to update your host operating system too, have a look\n"
"at [Host Upgrade and Repository Migration](host-upgrade-repo-migration) instructions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tato stránka popisuje pouze aktualizaci Zammadu. Pokud chcete aktualizovat i operační systém hostitele, podívejte se\n"
"na pokyny [Upgrade hostitele a migrace repozitáře](host-upgrade-repo-migration).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update package installation"
msgstr "Aktualizace instalace z balíčku"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check dependencies"
msgstr "Kontrola závislostí"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:32
msgid ""
"Before proceeding, double-check that your system environment matches "
"Zammad's requirements (see [Prerequisites](installation/prerequisites) and "
"[Package Installation](installation/package))."
msgstr ""
"Než budete pokračovat, ověřte, že vaše systémové prostředí splňuje požadavky "
"Zammadu (viz [Předpoklady](installation/prerequisites) a [Instalace z "
"balíčku](installation/package))."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backup Zammad"
msgstr "Záloha Zammadu"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:43
msgid ""
"Create a backup. You can use the [backup script](/en/tutorials/backup-"
"restore) which is shipped with the Zammad package."
msgstr ""
"Vytvořte zálohu. Můžete použít [zálohovací skript](/cs/tutorials/backup-"
"restore), který je součástí balíčku Zammadu."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you update your complete system and there are updates for Zammad **and** your\n"
"database server, this could lead to errors because your database may not be\n"
"online again when Zammad is updated.\n"
"\n"
"In such a case, you might want to exclude Zammad from updating temporarily as\n"
"you can see in the commands below.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pokud aktualizujete celý systém a jsou k dispozici aktualizace pro Zammad **i** váš\n"
"databázový server, může to vést k chybám, protože databáze nemusí být při aktualizaci\n"
"Zammadu ještě znovu dostupná.\n"
"\n"
"V takovém případě můžete Zammad z aktualizace dočasně vyloučit, jak\n"
"vidíte v příkazech níže.\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"Update package lists:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Disable updates for Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark hold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update all packages except Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt upgrade\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Re-enable updates for Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark unhold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt upgrade\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"Update package lists:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Disable updates for Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark hold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update all packages except Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt upgrade\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Re-enable updates for Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark unhold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt upgrade\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"Update package lists:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper refresh\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Disable updates for Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper addlock zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update all packages except Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Re-enable updates for Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper removelock zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"Update all packages except Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dnf upgrade --exclude zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dnf upgrade\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"Aktualizujte seznamy balíčků:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Zakažte aktualizace Zammadu:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark hold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Aktualizujte všechny balíčky kromě Zammadu:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt upgrade\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Znovu povolte aktualizace Zammadu:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark unhold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Aktualizujte Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt upgrade\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"Aktualizujte seznamy balíčků:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Zakažte aktualizace Zammadu:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark hold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Aktualizujte všechny balíčky kromě Zammadu:\n"
