"```\n"
"\n"
"Aktualizujte Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt upgrade\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"Aktualizujte seznamy balíčků:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper refresh\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Zakažte aktualizace Zammadu:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper addlock zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Aktualizujte všechny balíčky kromě Zammadu:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Znovu povolte aktualizace Zammadu:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper removelock zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Aktualizujte Zammad:\n"
"\n"
