"\n"
"=== Instalace v Dockeru\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"docker compose run --rm zammad-railsserver bundle exec rails c\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Instalace z balíčku\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"zammad run rails c\n"
"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Instalace ze zdrojového kódu / vývojová instalace\n"
