#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/cti.md:367
#, no-wrap
msgid "Call hangup"
msgstr "Zavěšení hovoru"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/cti.md:374
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`event` <Badge type=\"info\" text=\"hangup\" />:\n"
":\n"
"  Tell Zammad that someone answered the call.\n"
msgstr ""
"`event` <Badge type=\"info\" text=\"hangup\" />:\n"
":\n"
"  Oznámí Zammadu, že někdo hovor přijal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/cti.md:401
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`cause`\n"
":   This defines the reason of the hangup. Zammad evaluates the cause and indicates\n"
"    e.g. missed calls accordingly in the caller log. Possible values are:\n"
"    - `normalClearing` (one of the parties hung up after the call was established)\n"
"    - `busy` (the called party was busy)\n"
"    - `cancel` (the caller hung up before the called party picked up)\n"
"    - `noAnswer` (the called party rejected the call. E.g. through a DND setting)\n"
"    - `congestion` (the called party could not be reached)\n"
"    - `notFound` (the called number does not exist or called party is offline)\n"
"    - `forwarded` (the call was forwarded to a different party)\n"
msgstr ""
"`cause`\n"
":   Určuje důvod zavěšení. Zammad příčinu vyhodnotí a podle ní v protokolu hovorů\n"
"    označí např. zmeškané hovory. Možné hodnoty jsou:\n"
"    - `normalClearing` (jedna ze stran zavěsila po navázání hovoru)\n"
"    - `busy` (volaná strana byla obsazená)\n"
"    - `cancel` (volající zavěsil dříve, než volaná strana hovor přijala)\n"
"    - `noAnswer` (volaná strana hovor odmítla, např. kvůli nastavení Nerušit)\n"
"    - `congestion` (volanou stranu se nepodařilo zastihnout)\n"
"    - `notFound` (volané číslo neexistuje nebo je volaná strana offline)\n"
"    - `forwarded` (hovor byl přesměrován na jinou stranu)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/cti.md:408
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`answeringNumber` <Badge type=\"info\" text=\"493055571600\" />:\n"
":   Zammad will look up for a user with given value, the following attributes will be evaluated in given order:\n"
"    - `user.phone`\n"
"    - `user.login`\n"
"    - `user.if`\n"
"    This value is optional.\n"
msgstr ""
"`answeringNumber` <Badge type=\"info\" text=\"493055571600\" />:\n"
":   Zammad vyhledá uživatele se zadanou hodnotou; vyhodnocují se tyto atributy v uvedeném pořadí:\n"
"    - `user.phone`\n"
"    - `user.login`\n"
"    - `user.if`\n"
"    Tato hodnota je volitelná.\n"

