#. type: Title #
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/report-profile.md:1
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/report-profile.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Report profile"
msgstr "Profil reportu"

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/report-profile.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A report profile is a saved, reusable filter/condition for Zammad's\n"
"reporting module. It isn't an automation and doesn't do anything by\n"
"itself. It's a named condition that shows up as a selectable view when\n"
"generating reports with Zammad's reporting feature, scoped to whichever\n"
"roles (`role_ids`) can see it.\n"
"\n"
"Compare to [core workflows](/en/reference/rest-api/core-workflow), which\n"
"uses a similarly-shaped condition object but does not validate referenced\n"
"fields.\n"
msgstr ""
"Profil reportu je uložený, opakovaně použitelný filtr/podmínka pro reportovací\n"
"modul Zammadu. Nejde o automatizaci a sám o sobě nic nedělá.\n"
"Je to pojmenovaná podmínka, která se zobrazuje jako volitelný pohled při\n"
"vytváření reportů pomocí reportovací funkce Zammadu, omezená na ty\n"
"role (`role_ids`), které ji vidí.\n"
"\n"
"Srovnejte s [Core Workflow](/cs/reference/rest-api/core-workflow), které\n"
"používá podobně strukturovaný objekt podmínky, ale odkazovaná pole\n"
"neověřuje.\n"

