#. type: Title #
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/trigger.md:1
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/trigger.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Spouštěč"

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/trigger.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Triggers can run a `notification.webhook` action that references a\n"
"[webhook](/en/reference/rest-api/webhook) by id\n"
"(`{\"notification.webhook\": {\"webhook_id\": <id>}}`) instead of, or\n"
"alongside, `notification.email`. Create the webhook first, then point\n"
"the trigger's perform action at its `id`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Spouštěče mohou spouštět akci `notification.webhook`, která odkazuje na\n"
"[webhook](/cs/reference/rest-api/webhook) podle ID\n"
"(`{\"notification.webhook\": {\"webhook_id\": <id>}}`), místo akce\n"
"`notification.email` nebo vedle ní. Nejprve vytvořte webhook a pak v akci\n"
"spouštěče (perform) odkažte na jeho `id`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/trigger.md:19
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/trigger.md:40
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/trigger.md:52
