#. type: Title #
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:1
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Elasticsearch 9"
msgstr "Instalace Elasticsearch 9"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:14
msgid ""
"This guide shows a simple standard installation of Elasticsearch 9. The "
"intention is to get you up and running quickly.  However, in case you need a "
"more advanced configuration or face any issues, have a look at the [official "
"Elasticsearch installation documentation](https://www.elastic.co/docs/deploy-"
"manage/deploy/self-managed/installing-elasticsearch){target=_blank}.  Adapt "
"it wherever needed in case your use-case differs."
msgstr ""
"Tento návod ukazuje jednoduchou standardní instalaci Elasticsearch 9. Cílem "
"je rychle vás uvést do provozu. Pokud však potřebujete pokročilejší "
"konfiguraci nebo narazíte na problémy, podívejte se do [oficiální "
"dokumentace k instalaci Elasticsearch](https://www.elastic.co/docs/deploy-"
"manage/deploy/self-managed/installing-elasticsearch){target=_blank}. Pokud "
"se váš případ použití liší, upravte postup podle potřeby."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add repository key"
msgstr "Přidání klíče repozitáře"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu/Debian\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"curl -fsSL https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch | \\\n"
"  gpg --dearmor | sudo tee /usr/share/keyrings/elasticsearch-keyring.gpg \\\n"
"  && sudo chmod 644 /usr/share/keyrings/elasticsearch-keyring.gpg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"sudo rpm --import https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"sudo rpm --import https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu/Debian\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"curl -fsSL https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch | \\\n"
"  gpg --dearmor | sudo tee /usr/share/keyrings/elasticsearch-keyring.gpg \\\n"
"  && sudo chmod 644 /usr/share/keyrings/elasticsearch-keyring.gpg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"sudo rpm --import https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"sudo rpm --import https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add repository"
msgstr "Přidání repozitáře"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu/Debian\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"echo \"deb [signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/elasticsearch-keyring.gpg] https://artifacts.elastic.co/packages/9.x/apt stable main\" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/elastic-9.x.list\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo cat << EOF > /etc/zypp/repos.d/elasticsearch.repo\n"
"[elasticsearch]\n"
"name=Elasticsearch repository for 9.x packages\n"
"baseurl=https://artifacts.elastic.co/packages/9.x/yum\n"
"gpgcheck=1\n"
"gpgkey=https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch\n"
"enabled=0\n"
"autorefresh=1\n"
"type=rpm-md\n"
"EOF\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo cat << EOF > /etc/yum.repos.d/elasticsearch.repo\n"
"[elasticsearch]\n"
"name=Elasticsearch repository for 9.x packages\n"
"baseurl=https://artifacts.elastic.co/packages/9.x/yum\n"
"gpgcheck=1\n"
"gpgkey=https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch\n"
"enabled=0\n"
"type=rpm-md\n"
"EOF\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu/Debian\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"echo \"deb [signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/elasticsearch-keyring.gpg] https://artifacts.elastic.co/packages/9.x/apt stable main\" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/elastic-9.x.list\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo cat << EOF > /etc/zypp/repos.d/elasticsearch.repo\n"
"[elasticsearch]\n"
"name=Elasticsearch repository for 9.x packages\n"
"baseurl=https://artifacts.elastic.co/packages/9.x/yum\n"
"gpgcheck=1\n"
"gpgkey=https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch\n"
"enabled=0\n"
"autorefresh=1\n"
"type=rpm-md\n"
"EOF\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo cat << EOF > /etc/yum.repos.d/elasticsearch.repo\n"
"[elasticsearch]\n"
"name=Elasticsearch repository for 9.x packages\n"
"baseurl=https://artifacts.elastic.co/packages/9.x/yum\n"
"gpgcheck=1\n"
"gpgkey=https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch\n"
"enabled=0\n"
"type=rpm-md\n"
"EOF\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:86
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu/Debian\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"sudo apt update && sudo apt install elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper modifyrepo --enable elasticsearch && sudo zypper install elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"RHEL 7 or earlier:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo yum install --enablerepo=elasticsearch elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"CentOS and RHEL 8 and later:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dnf install --enablerepo=elasticsearch elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu/Debian\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"sudo apt update && sudo apt install elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper modifyrepo --enable elasticsearch && sudo zypper install elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"RHEL 7 nebo starší:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo yum install --enablerepo=elasticsearch elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"CentOS a RHEL 8 a novější:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dnf install --enablerepo=elasticsearch elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:116
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Make sure to check the output and to copy the password of the built-in superuser. Otherwise, you have to recreate it by\n"
"running `/usr/share/elasticsearch/bin/elasticsearch-reset-password -u elastic`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nezapomeňte zkontrolovat výstup a zkopírovat heslo vestavěného superuživatele. Jinak ho budete muset znovu vytvořit\n"
"spuštěním `/usr/share/elasticsearch/bin/elasticsearch-reset-password -u elastic`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:121
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurace"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:125
msgid ""
"Optionally, check and configure Elasticsearch’s configuration file which you "
"can find under `/etc/elasticsearch/elasticsearch.yml`."
msgstr ""
"Volitelně zkontrolujte a upravte konfigurační soubor Elasticsearch, který "
"najdete v `/etc/elasticsearch/elasticsearch.yml`."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:128
msgid ""
"We recommend to adjust the maximum context size which should get indexed by "
"Elasticsearch. Adjust it to a reasonable size like in the example:"
msgstr ""
"Doporučujeme upravit maximální velikost obsahu, který má Elasticsearch "
"indexovat. Nastavte rozumnou velikost jako v příkladu:"

#. type: Fenced code block (yml)
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:129
#, no-wrap
msgid "http.max_content_length: 400mb\n"
msgstr "http.max_content_length: 400mb\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:135
msgid ""
"Additional configuration is out of scope of this documentation. In case your "
"scenario needs additional configuration, have a look at [Elastic’s "
"configuration reference](https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/"
"configuration-reference){target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"Další konfigurace přesahuje rámec této dokumentace. Pokud váš scénář "
"vyžaduje další konfiguraci, podívejte se do [referenční příručky konfigurace "
"Elastic](https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/configuration-"
"reference){target=_blank}."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:136
#, no-wrap
msgid "Start and enable Elasticsearch"
msgstr "Spuštění a povolení Elasticsearch"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:138
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl enable elasticsearch.service --now\n"
msgstr "sudo systemctl enable elasticsearch.service --now\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:146
msgid ""
"Go on with the [installation of Zammad](/en/get-started/installation/"
"package#add-zammad-repository). After the installation of Zammad is "
"completed, you can [connect Zammad with Elasticsearch](/en/tutorials/connect-"
"config-elasticsearch)."
msgstr ""
"Pokračujte [instalací Zammadu](/cs/get-started/installation/package#pridani-"
"repozitare-zammadu). Po dokončení instalace Zammadu můžete [propojit Zammad "
"s Elasticsearch](/cs/tutorials/connect-config-elasticsearch)."

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:1 src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate Zammad to new host"
msgstr "Migrace Zammadu na nového hostitele"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:14
msgid ""
"This is just a description of basic steps to perform a migration to a new "
"host. Your environment may be different so you should consider this as a "
"reference point only. If anything goes wrong, please consult the [Zammad "
"Community](https://community.zammad.org/c/trouble-running-zammad-this-is-"
"your-place/5){target=_blank} or consider [paid support options](https://"
"zammad.com/en/services/professional-services){target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"Toto je pouze popis základních kroků migrace na nového hostitele. Vaše "
"prostředí se může lišit, proto ho berte jen jako výchozí bod. Pokud se něco "
"pokazí, obraťte se na [komunitu Zammadu](https://community.zammad.org/c/"
"trouble-running-zammad-this-is-your-place/5){target=_blank} nebo zvažte "
"[placenou podporu](https://zammad.com/en/services/professional-services)"
"{target=_blank}."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:18
msgid ""
"The steps described on this page are an addition to the [backup and restore "
"guide](/en/tutorials/backup-restore). They're not meant to stand alone - "
"we'll link and note this in the relevant parts."
msgstr ""
"Kroky popsané na této stránce doplňují [návod k zálohování a obnovení](/cs/"
"tutorials/backup-restore). Nejsou určeny k samostatnému použití – v "
"příslušných částech na to odkážeme a upozorníme."

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Migrating from Zammad SaaS? Skip to\n"
"[Step 7](#step-7-transfer-your-backup-files). For restoration, you've\n"
"received an attachment dump!\n"
msgstr ""
"Migrujete ze Zammad SaaS? Přeskočte na\n"
"[krok 7](#krok-7-preneste-soubory-zalohy). Pro obnovení jste\n"
"obdrželi dump příloh!\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Note down your environmental adjustments"
msgstr "Krok 1: Poznamenejte si úpravy prostředí"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:28
msgid ""
"If you have set any environment variables or similar, make sure to backup "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Pokud jste nastavili proměnné prostředí nebo podobné úpravy, nezapomeňte si "
"je zálohovat."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Install Zammad on the destination host"
msgstr "Krok 2: Nainstalujte Zammad na cílového hostitele"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:35
msgid ""
"For the easiest restoration path possible, please install the same version "
"like your origin instance. You could also consider updating the old instance "
"before migrating. The following guide assumes that you have the same version "
"of Zammad on your old and new host."
msgstr ""
"Pro co nejjednodušší obnovení nainstalujte stejnou verzi, jakou má původní "
"instance. Můžete také zvážit aktualizaci staré instance před migrací. "
"Následující návod předpokládá, že na starém i novém hostiteli máte stejnou "
"verzi Zammadu."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Activate maintenance mode"
msgstr "Krok 3: Zapněte režim údržby"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This ends all agent and customer sessions. Activate it in Zammad's admin\n"
"interface under _System > Maintenance_.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tím se ukončí všechny relace agentů a zákazníků. Zapnete ho v administraci\n"
"Zammadu v sekci _Systém > Údržba_.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Disable your communication channels"
msgstr "Krok 4: Vypněte komunikační kanály"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:45
msgid ""
"The restore script starts Zammad automatically, this may help to avoid data "
"loss and inconsistencies."
msgstr ""
"Skript pro obnovení spouští Zammad automaticky, tento krok proto pomáhá "
"předejít ztrátě dat a nekonzistencím."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5: Stop and disable Zammad"
msgstr "Krok 5: Zastavte a zakažte Zammad"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:49
msgid "Make sure that no data will be changed _before_ backing up."
msgstr "Ujistěte se, že se _před_ zálohováním nebudou měnit žádná data."

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl disable zammad\n"
msgstr "sudo systemctl disable zammad\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6: Backup"
msgstr "Krok 6: Záloha"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:62
msgid ""
"Follow the [backup guide](/en/tutorials/backup-restore#) to create your "
"backup."
msgstr ""
"Zálohu vytvořte podle [návodu k zálohování](/cs/tutorials/backup-restore)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:65
msgid ""
"Remember if you've created a full filesystem dump or only backed up your "
"data. This will be important for the restoration."
msgstr ""
"Zapamatujte si, zda jste vytvořili úplný dump souborového systému, nebo "
"zálohovali jen data. To bude důležité při obnovení."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:67
msgid "If you want to go the easiest way, consider only dumping your data."
msgstr "Pokud chcete jít nejjednodušší cestou, zvažte dump pouze dat."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 7: Transfer your backup files"
msgstr "Krok 7: Přeneste soubory zálohy"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:74
msgid ""
"Save your backup files in a directory and provide the path to the `config` "
"file. Under [backup configuration](/en/tutorials/backup-restore#backup-"
"configuration) you can find how to adjust the config file to your needs."
msgstr ""
"Uložte soubory zálohy do adresáře a jeho cestu uveďte v souboru `config`. V "
"části [konfigurace zálohování](/cs/tutorials/backup-restore#konfigurace-"
"zalohy) najdete, jak konfigurační soubor upravit podle svých potřeb."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 8: Restore your backup"
msgstr "Krok 8: Obnovte zálohu"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:79
msgid ""
"Follow the [restoration guide](/en/tutorials/backup-restore#restore-"
"backups)  up to and including \"Run the Restore\" to restore the backup on "
"the new host."
msgstr ""
"Zálohu na novém hostiteli obnovte podle [návodu k obnovení](/cs/tutorials/"
"backup-restore#obnova-zaloh), a to až po krok \"Spuštění obnovy\" včetně."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:81
msgid "Make sure to stop Zammad after the restoration has finished."
msgstr "Po dokončení obnovení Zammad nezapomeňte zastavit."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9: Run required maintenance tasks after restoring"
msgstr "Krok 9: Proveďte po obnovení potřebné úkony údržby"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:86
msgid ""
"After successful restoration, please continue below depending if you've only "
"backed up your data or have a full filesystem dump."
msgstr ""
"Po úspěšném obnovení pokračujte níže podle toho, zda jste zálohovali jen "
"data, nebo máte úplný dump souborového systému."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "Data dump"
msgstr "Dump dat"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9.1: Clear the cache"
msgstr "Krok 9.1: Vymažte mezipaměť"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:91 src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:157
#, no-wrap
msgid "zammad run rails r \"Rails.cache.clear\"\n"
msgstr "zammad run rails r \"Rails.cache.clear\"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "Full filesystem dump"
msgstr "Úplný dump souborového systému"

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:97
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This step is only needed, if one of the following points is met:\n"
"\n"
"- The source and destination Zammad versions are not the same\n"
"- The Zammad installation is not a source code installation\n"
"- The Zammad backup is not an export from our hosted setup\n"
"\n"
"Full dumps for source code installations are not covered, however,\n"
"basically the same below applies to you: You have to ensure that the\n"
"environments and application files are overwritten with the new /\n"
"correct version.\n"
"\n"
"Zammad files are distribution and version specific!\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento krok je potřeba, jen pokud platí některý z následujících bodů:\n"
"\n"
"- Zdrojová a cílová verze Zammadu nejsou stejné\n"
"- Instalace Zammadu není instalací ze zdrojového kódu\n"
"- Záloha Zammadu není exportem z našeho hostovaného prostředí\n"
"\n"
"Úplné dumpy instalací ze zdrojového kódu zde nepopisujeme, v zásadě\n"
"však i pro vás platí totéž co níže: musíte zajistit, aby prostředí\n"
"a soubory aplikace byly přepsány novou /\n"
"správnou verzí.\n"
"\n"
"Soubory Zammadu jsou specifické pro distribuci a verzi!\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9.1: Uninstall and reinstall Zammad without resolving dependencies"
msgstr "Krok 9.1: Odinstalujte a znovu nainstalujte Zammad bez řešení závislostí"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:114
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dpkg -r --force-depends zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"sudo zypper remove -R zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper install zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dpkg -r --force-depends zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"sudo zypper remove -R zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper install zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:138
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You're unsure if above is really required and a mere reinstall would be\n"
"enough? If you run a dedicated install command on for Zammad and receive\n"
"the following, you absolutely have to run above to fix your\n"
"installation.\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"root@zammad:/# apt update && apt install zammad\n"
"  Reading package lists... Done\n"
"  Building dependency tree\n"
"  Reading state information... Done\n"
"  zammad is already the newest version (x.x.x-xxxxxx.xxxxxx.xxx).\n"
"  0 upgraded, 0 newly installed, 0 to remove and 0 not upgraded.\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Nejste si jisti, zda je výše uvedené opravdu nutné, nebo by stačila\n"
"obyčejná reinstalace? Pokud spustíte samostatný instalační příkaz pro Zammad a dostanete\n"
"následující výstup, musíte výše uvedené bezpodmínečně provést, abyste svou\n"
"instalaci opravili.\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"root@zammad:/# apt update && apt install zammad\n"
"  Reading package lists... Done\n"
"  Building dependency tree\n"
"  Reading state information... Done\n"
"  zammad is already the newest version (x.x.x-xxxxxx.xxxxxx.xxx).\n"
"  0 upgraded, 0 newly installed, 0 to remove and 0 not upgraded.\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:155
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9.2: Clear the cache"
msgstr "Krok 9.2: Vymažte mezipaměť"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:161
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9.3: Ensure Zammad is running"
msgstr "Krok 9.3: Ověřte, že Zammad běží"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:163
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl status zammad\n"
msgstr "sudo systemctl status zammad\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:168
msgid "If Zammad is not running, run:"
msgstr "Pokud Zammad neběží, spusťte:"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:173
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Migrated from Zammad SaaS or switching provider?\n"
"\n"
"Please make sure that your email notification channel and\n"
"FQDN configuration is correct.\n"
msgstr ""
"Migrovali jste ze Zammad SaaS nebo měníte poskytovatele?\n"
"\n"
"Ujistěte se, že je správně nastaven e-mailový kanál pro oznámení\n"
"a konfigurace FQDN.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:180
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 10: Apply missing environmental settings"
msgstr "Krok 10: Znovu použijte chybějící nastavení prostředí"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:184
msgid ""
"If you've set any environmental settings please re-apply your settings now.  "
"You backed them up in [Step 1](#step-1-note-down-your-environmental-"
"adjustments)."
msgstr ""
"Pokud jste měli nastavená nějaká nastavení prostředí, použijte je nyní "
"znovu. Zálohovali jste si je v [kroku 1](#krok-1-poznamenejte-si-upravy-"
"prostredi)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:188
msgid ""
"If not already done, please [install Elasticsearch](/en/tutorials/install-"
"elasticsearch) now and perform the steps to [connect to and configure "
"Elasticsearch](/en/tutorials/connect-config-elasticsearch) after "
"installation."
msgstr ""
"Pokud jste tak ještě neučinili, [nainstalujte nyní Elasticsearch](/cs/"
"tutorials/install-elasticsearch) a po instalaci proveďte kroky k [propojení "
"a konfiguraci Elasticsearch](/cs/tutorials/connect-config-elasticsearch)."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:189
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 11: Re-enable channels and deactivate maintenance mode"
msgstr "Krok 11: Znovu zapněte kanály a vypněte režim údržby"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:194
msgid ""
"Set the previous deactivated channels back to active if you're sure "
"everything was successful. At this point Zammad will start to _change data_!"
msgstr ""
"Pokud jste si jisti, že vše proběhlo úspěšně, znovu aktivujte dříve "
"deaktivované kanály. Od této chvíle začne Zammad _měnit data_!"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:196
msgid ""
"After verifying the functionality of your channels, allow your agents and "
"customers to log in again by disabling the maintenance mode."
msgstr ""
"Po ověření funkčnosti kanálů vypněte režim údržby, aby se agenti a zákazníci "
"mohli znovu přihlásit."

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:1 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate to Zammad"
msgstr "Migrace do Zammadu"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:9
msgid ""
"You can migrate the following data from another ticketing system to Zammad:"
msgstr ""
"Z jiného systému pro správu tiketů můžete do Zammadu migrovat následující "
"data:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:14
msgid "Tickets and their Articles"
msgstr "Tikety a jejich články"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:14
msgid "Groups / Queues"
msgstr "Skupiny / fronty"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:14
msgid "Organizations"
msgstr "Organizace"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:14
msgid "Agents and Customers (if applicable)"
msgstr "Agenty a zákazníky (pokud je to relevantní)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After migrating to Zammad, you should first adjust your FQDN settings and HTTP\n"
"type in Zammad's admin interface under _Settings > System > Base_.\n"
"This is important because the getting started wizard is skipped by the\n"
"migration.\n"
msgstr ""
"Po migraci do Zammadu byste nejprve měli upravit nastavení FQDN a typu\n"
"HTTP v administraci Zammadu v sekci _Nastavení > Systém > Základní_.\n"
"To je důležité, protože průvodce prvním spuštěním se při migraci\n"
"přeskakuje.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:23
msgid ""
"After that, you may want to continue with the [First Steps](/en/tutorials/"
"first-steps) to configure Zammad. This has to be done after migration."
msgstr ""
"Poté můžete pokračovat [prvními kroky](/cs/tutorials/first-steps) a Zammad "
"nakonfigurovat. To je nutné udělat až po migraci."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "General limitations"
msgstr "Obecná omezení"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:29
msgid ""
"There are some general limitations which you can find below. There could "
"also be limitations, depending from which system you are coming. These are "
"covered in the specific sections."
msgstr ""
"Níže najdete některá obecná omezení. V závislosti na systému, ze kterého "
"přecházíte, mohou platit i další omezení. Ta jsou popsána v příslušných "
"částech."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:31
msgid "General limitations for all migrations:"
msgstr "Obecná omezení pro všechny migrace:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:38
msgid "Migrations are only possible on new instances."
msgstr "Migrace jsou možné pouze do nových instancí."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:38
msgid ""
"Migrations are only possible from one source. Several migration sources on "
"one instance are not supported."
msgstr ""
"Migrace je možná pouze z jednoho zdroje. Více zdrojů migrace do jedné "
"instance není podporováno."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:38
msgid ""
"Zammad can't migrate object types it doesn't know, migrations will fail."
msgstr ""
"Zammad nedokáže migrovat typy objektů, které nezná – migrace v takovém "
"případě selže."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:38
msgid ""
"Zammad migrates all or nothing. This means that you can't deselect specific "
"information specific groups, tickets or users."
msgstr ""
"Zammad migruje vše, nebo nic. To znamená, že nemůžete vyloučit konkrétní "
"informace, konkrétní skupiny, tikety ani uživatele."

#. type: Fenced div block (warning)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"Import mode also activates the maintenance mode, for as long as import mode is\n"
"enabled. Zammad then denies every request of a user without the `admin.maintenance`\n"
"permission. Turn import mode off again before letting users work in the instance.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Režim importu po celou dobu, kdy je zapnutý, aktivuje také režim údržby.\n"
"Zammad pak odmítne každý požadavek uživatele bez oprávnění `admin.maintenance`.\n"
"Než necháte uživatele v instanci pracovat, režim importu opět vypněte.\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specific migration guides"
msgstr "Návody pro konkrétní migrace"

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"**Missing a migration source?**\n"
"\n"
"If your system it not mentioned yet, you'll have two options. You can either\n"
"use Zammad's powerful API or drop our\n"
"[sales team a message](https://zammad.com/en/company/contact){target=_blank} for a custom\n"
"development or even migrator sponsoring.\n"
"\n"
"Migrations are available for hosted setups too! Contact support for further\n"
"information!\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"**Chybí vám zdroj migrace?**\n"
"\n"
"Pokud váš systém zatím není uveden, máte dvě možnosti. Můžete buď\n"
"použít výkonné API Zammadu, nebo\n"
"[napsat našemu obchodnímu týmu](https://zammad.com/en/company/contact){target=_blank} kvůli vývoji na\n"
"zakázku, případně i sponzorování migrátoru.\n"
"\n"
"Migrace jsou dostupné i pro hostovaná prostředí! Další informace vám\n"
"poskytne podpora!\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Freshdesk"
msgstr "Freshdesk"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:68 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:212
msgid ""
"Please note Freshdesk specific limitations below. These are additional "
"limitations to the general ones listed."
msgstr ""
"Níže najdete omezení specifická pro Freshdesk. Platí navíc k uvedeným "
"obecným omezením."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:79 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:227
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:499
msgid ""
"Differential migrations are not supported! The general suggestion is to run "
"a test import before to learn how long the migration will take."
msgstr ""
"Rozdílové migrace nejsou podporovány! Obecně doporučujeme nejprve provést "
"zkušební import, abyste zjistili, jak dlouho bude migrace trvat."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:79
msgid ""
"Important: Please note that migration speed highly depends on your Freshdesk "
"plan (API rate limits apply)."
msgstr ""
"Důležité: Rychlost migrace výrazně závisí na vašem tarifu Freshdesk "
"(uplatňují se limity API)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:79
msgid ""
"Due to API limitations, Zammad will not show the total number of objects to "
"import, but instead correct them in steps of 100."
msgstr ""
"Kvůli omezením API nezobrazuje Zammad celkový počet importovaných objektů, "
"ale upravuje ho po krocích po 100."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:79
msgid ""
"Your Freshdesk plan has to provide API support. This may not apply to all "
"available plans."
msgstr ""
"Váš tarif Freshdesk musí podporovat API. To nemusí platit pro všechny "
"dostupné tarify."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:79 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:227
msgid ""
"User passwords are not migrated and will require the user to use the "
"password reset link on Zammad's login page."
msgstr ""
"Hesla uživatelů se nemigrují a uživatelé budou muset použít odkaz pro "
"obnovení hesla na přihlašovací stránce Zammadu."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:86
msgid ""
"Zammad requires API access which is why you'll need to [create an API key]"
"(https://support.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/215517-how-to-find-"
"your-api-key){target=_blank} for the migration. The migrator will request "
"your Freshdesk subdomain and API key."
msgstr ""
"Zammad vyžaduje přístup k API, proto budete pro migraci potřebovat [vytvořit "
"API klíč](https://support.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/215517-"
"how-to-find-your-api-key){target=_blank}. Migrátor si vyžádá vaši subdoménu "
"Freshdesk a API klíč."

#. type: Fenced div block (warning)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:87 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:507
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Ensure to retrieve the API key with a full administrator account. Less\n"
"privileged users will end in a broken migration.\n"
msgstr ""
"API klíč získejte pomocí účtu s plnými administrátorskými právy. U uživatelů\n"
"s nižšími oprávněními skončí migrace nefunkční.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:92 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:238
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:408 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:512
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Import"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:97 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:243
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:517
msgid ""
"In general, you have two options on how to migrate data. If you have a "
"fairly big instance with a lot of data, you may want to consider using the "
"console over the browser version."
msgstr ""
"Data můžete obecně migrovat dvěma způsoby. Pokud máte poměrně velkou "
"instanci s velkým množstvím dat, zvažte místo verze v prohlížeči použití "
"konzole."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:98
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Via Browser\n"
"\n"
"After installing Zammad and\n"
"[configuring your webserver](./webserver-config), navigate to your\n"
"Zammads FQDN in your browser and follow the migration wizard. You can find\n"
"it in the log in screen by clicking the \"Or migrate from another system\"\n"
"link at the bottom.\n"
"\n"
"Depending on the number of users, tickets and Freshdesk plan this may take a\n"
"while.\n"
"\n"
"Seeing the message \"_Interrupted by scheduler restart. Please restart manually\n"
"or wait till next execution time._\"?\n"
"If this message appears after providing your credentials, please be patient.\n"
"The migration should start within 5 minutes.\n"
"\n"
"If you receive above message after the migration begun, please consider using\n"
"the console approach instead and reset the installation.\n"
"\n"
"=== Via Console\n"
"\n"
"Open console:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"zammad run rails c\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Set variables, replace the values in `{}` with your own:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"subdomain = '{freshdesk subdomain}.freshdesk.com'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"token = '{freshdesk token}'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update Zammad settings for freshdesk import:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_freshdesk_endpoint', \"https://#{subdomain}/api/v2\")\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_freshdesk_endpoint_key', token)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_backend', 'freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_mode', true)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Check your configuration in a dry run:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Sequencer.process('Import::Freshdesk::ConnectionTest')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Run the migration:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"job = ImportJob.create(name: 'Import::Freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"AsyncImportJob.perform_later(job)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== V prohlížeči\n"
"\n"
"Po instalaci Zammadu a\n"
"[konfiguraci webového serveru](./webserver-config) otevřete v prohlížeči\n"
"FQDN svého Zammadu a postupujte podle průvodce migrací. Najdete ho\n"
"na přihlašovací obrazovce po kliknutí na odkaz \"Nebo migrujte z jiného systému\"\n"
"dole.\n"
"\n"
"V závislosti na počtu uživatelů, tiketů a tarifu Freshdesk to může chvíli\n"
"trvat.\n"
"\n"
"Zobrazuje se vám zpráva \"_Interrupted by scheduler restart. Please restart manually\n"
"or wait till next execution time._\"?\n"
"Pokud se tato zpráva objeví po zadání přihlašovacích údajů, buďte trpěliví.\n"
"Migrace by se měla spustit do 5 minut.\n"
"\n"
"Pokud se výše uvedená zpráva zobrazí až po zahájení migrace, zvažte raději\n"
"postup přes konzoli a instalaci resetujte.\n"
"\n"
"=== Přes konzoli\n"
"\n"
"Otevřete konzoli:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"zammad run rails c\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Nastavte proměnné, hodnoty v `{}` nahraďte vlastními:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"subdomain = '{freshdesk subdomain}.freshdesk.com'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"token = '{freshdesk token}'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Upravte nastavení Zammadu pro import z Freshdesku:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_freshdesk_endpoint', \"https://#{subdomain}/api/v2\")\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
