#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:397
#, no-wrap
msgid "Timeout adjustments"
msgstr "Úprava časových limitů"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:402
msgid ""
"If your import runs in a timeout or you already know that this could be an "
"issue, you can adjust timeouts via environment variables. To do so, set the "
"environment variables `ZAMMAD_OTRS_IMPORT_READ_TIMEOUT` and "
"`ZAMMAD_OTRS_IMPORT_TOTAL_TIMEOUT` with a higher timeout in seconds. If not "
"set, the defaults apply:"
msgstr ""
"Pokud import narazí na vypršení časového limitu nebo už víte, že by to mohl "
"být problém, můžete časové limity upravit pomocí proměnných prostředí. "
"Nastavte proměnné prostředí `ZAMMAD_OTRS_IMPORT_READ_TIMEOUT` a "
"`ZAMMAD_OTRS_IMPORT_TOTAL_TIMEOUT` na vyšší časový limit v sekundách. Pokud "
"nejsou nastaveny, platí výchozí hodnoty:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:407
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|                                    | Zammad < 7.0 | Zammad ≥ 7.0  |\n"
"|------------------------------------|--------------|---------------|\n"
"| `ZAMMAD_OTRS_IMPORT_READ_TIMEOUT`  | 120          | 600           |\n"
"| `ZAMMAD_OTRS_IMPORT_TOTAL_TIMEOUT` | 360          | 1200          |\n"
msgstr ""
"|                                    | Zammad < 7.0 | Zammad ≥ 7.0  |\n"
"|------------------------------------|--------------|---------------|\n"
"| `ZAMMAD_OTRS_IMPORT_READ_TIMEOUT`  | 120          | 600           |\n"
"| `ZAMMAD_OTRS_IMPORT_TOTAL_TIMEOUT` | 360          | 1200          |\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:410
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Via Browser\n"
"\n"
"After installing Zammad and\n"
"[configuring your webserver](/en/tutorials/webserver-config), navigate to your\n"
"Zammads FQDN in your browser and follow the migration wizard. You can find\n"
"it in the log in screen by clicking the \"Or migrate from another system\"\n"
"link at the bottom.\n"
"\n"
"Depending on the size of your OTRS installation this may take a while. In such\n"
"a case, consider using the command line version of this feature. This also\n"
"applies if you experience timeouts during the migration.\n"
"\n"
"=== Via Console\n"
"\n"
"Open console:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"zammad run rails c\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Set variables, replace the values in `{}` with your own:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_otrs_endpoint', 'https://{domain}/otrs/public.pl?Action=ZammadMigrator')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_otrs_endpoint_key', '{xxx}')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_mode', true)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Run a full migration:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Import::OTRS.start\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Run a differential migration (only possible after finishing an earlier full\n"
"migration):\n"
"\n"
"All steps from \"Set variables\" +\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('system_init_done', false)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Import::OTRS.diff_worker\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== V prohlížeči\n"
"\n"
"Po instalaci Zammadu a\n"
"[konfiguraci webového serveru](/cs/tutorials/webserver-config) otevřete v prohlížeči\n"
"FQDN svého Zammadu a postupujte podle průvodce migrací. Najdete ho\n"
"na přihlašovací obrazovce po kliknutí na odkaz \"Nebo migrujte z jiného systému\"\n"
"dole.\n"
"\n"
"V závislosti na velikosti vaší instalace OTRS to může chvíli trvat. V takovém\n"
"případě zvažte použití této funkce z příkazového řádku. To platí i tehdy,\n"
"pokud během migrace dochází k vypršení časového limitu.\n"
"\n"
"=== Přes konzoli\n"
"\n"
"Otevřete konzoli:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"zammad run rails c\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Nastavte proměnné, hodnoty v `{}` nahraďte vlastními:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_otrs_endpoint', 'https://{domain}/otrs/public.pl?Action=ZammadMigrator')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_otrs_endpoint_key', '{xxx}')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_mode', true)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Spusťte úplnou migraci:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Import::OTRS.start\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Spusťte rozdílovou migraci (možné pouze po dokončení předchozí úplné\n"
"migrace):\n"
"\n"
"Všechny kroky od \"Nastavte proměnné\" +\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('system_init_done', false)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Import::OTRS.diff_worker\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:483
#, no-wrap
msgid "Zendesk"
msgstr "Zendesk"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:499
msgid ""
"Important: Please note that migration speed highly depends on your Zendesk "
"plan (API rate limits apply)."
msgstr ""
"Důležité: Rychlost migrace výrazně závisí na vašem tarifu Zendesk (uplatňují "
"se limity API)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:499
msgid ""
"Your Zendesk plan has to provide API support. This may not apply to all "
"available plans."
msgstr ""
"Váš tarif Zendesk musí podporovat API. To nemusí platit pro všechny dostupné "
"tarify."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:499
msgid ""
"User passwords are not migrated and will require the user to use the "
"password reset link on the login page."
msgstr ""
"Hesla uživatelů se nemigrují a uživatelé budou muset použít odkaz pro "
"obnovení hesla na přihlašovací stránce."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:499
msgid ""
"Objects with cyrillic strings can't be migrated. Make sure to rename them "
"before starting the migration."
msgstr ""
"Objekty s řetězci v cyrilici nelze migrovat. Před zahájením migrace je "
"přejmenujte."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:506
msgid ""
"Zammad requires API access which is why you’ll need to [create an API key]"
"(https://support.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/4408889192858-Generating-a-"
"new-API-token){target=_blank} for the migration. The migrator will request "
"your Zendesk-URL, email address and API key."
msgstr ""
"Zammad vyžaduje přístup k API, proto budete pro migraci potřebovat [vytvořit "
"API klíč](https://support.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/4408889192858-"
"Generating-a-new-API-token){target=_blank}. Migrátor si vyžádá vaši URL "
"Zendesk, e-mailovou adresu a API klíč."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:518
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Via Browser\n"
"\n"
"After installing Zammad and\n"
"[configuring your webserver](/en/tutorials/webserver-config), navigate to your\n"
"Zammads FQDN in your browser and follow the migration wizard. You can find\n"
"it in the log in screen by clicking the \"Or migrate from another system\"\n"
"link at the bottom.\n"
"\n"
"Depending on the number of users, tickets and Zendesk plan, this may take a\n"
"while.\n"
"\n"
"=== Via Console\n"
"\n"
"Open console:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"zammad run rails c\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Set variables, replace the values in `{}` with your own:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"subdomain = '{zendesk url}'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"email = '{zendesk admin email address}'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"token = '{zendesk token}'\n"
"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update Zammad settings:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_zendesk_endpoint', \"https://#{subdomain}/api/v2\")\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_zendesk_endpoint_username', email)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_zendesk_endpoint_key', token)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_backend', 'zendesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_mode', true)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Check your configuration in a dry run:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Sequencer.process('Import::Zendesk::ConnectionTest')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Run the migration:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"job = ImportJob.create(name: 'Import::Zendesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"AsyncImportJob.perform_later(job)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== V prohlížeči\n"
"\n"
"Po instalaci Zammadu a\n"
"[konfiguraci webového serveru](/cs/tutorials/webserver-config) otevřete v prohlížeči\n"
"FQDN svého Zammadu a postupujte podle průvodce migrací. Najdete ho\n"
"na přihlašovací obrazovce po kliknutí na odkaz \"Nebo migrujte z jiného systému\"\n"
"dole.\n"
"\n"
"V závislosti na počtu uživatelů, tiketů a tarifu Zendesk to může chvíli\n"
"trvat.\n"
"\n"
"=== Přes konzoli\n"
"\n"
"Otevřete konzoli:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"zammad run rails c\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Nastavte proměnné, hodnoty v `{}` nahraďte vlastními:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"subdomain = '{zendesk url}'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"email = '{zendesk admin email address}'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"token = '{zendesk token}'\n"
"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Upravte nastavení Zammadu:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_zendesk_endpoint', \"https://#{subdomain}/api/v2\")\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_zendesk_endpoint_username', email)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_zendesk_endpoint_key', token)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_backend', 'zendesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_mode', true)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Ověřte konfiguraci zkušebním během:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Sequencer.process('Import::Zendesk::ConnectionTest')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Spusťte migraci:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"job = ImportJob.create(name: 'Import::Zendesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"AsyncImportJob.perform_later(job)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/tutorials/reporting-grafana.md:1
#: src/en/tutorials/reporting-grafana.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reporting with Grafana"
msgstr "Reporty s Grafanou"

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/tutorials/reporting-grafana.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide is about Grafana. If you want to use another tool, check if it\n"
"supports Elasticsearch indexes. If yes, then you are good to go!\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento návod se týká Grafany. Pokud chcete použít jiný nástroj, ověřte, zda\n"
"podporuje indexy Elasticsearch. Pokud ano, můžete začít!\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/reporting-grafana.md:16
msgid ""
"Grafana is a third party analytics/visualization application you can connect "
"to Zammad (precisely: Elasticsearch). It can access the Elasticsearch index "
"and visualize your Zammad data."
msgstr ""
"Grafana je analytická a vizualizační aplikace třetí strany, kterou můžete "
"připojit k Zammadu (přesněji k Elasticsearch). Dokáže přistupovat k indexu "
"Elasticsearch a vizualizovat data ze Zammadu."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/reporting-grafana.md:21
msgid ""
"This guide will provide you some steps to get started. For a deeper insight "
"you should consider having a look at [Elasticsearch's indexed attributes](/"
"en/reference/es-indexed-attributes) and to read the [documentation of "
"Grafana](https://grafana.com/docs/){target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"Tento návod vám ukáže několik kroků, jak začít. Pro hlubší pochopení "
"doporučujeme projít si [atributy indexované v Elasticsearch](/cs/reference/"
"es-indexed-attributes) a přečíst si [dokumentaci Grafany](https://"
"grafana.com/docs/){target=_blank}."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/reporting-grafana.md:25
msgid ""
"This guide expects all requirements to be up and running. We will not cover "
"core configurations of each tool. Please also note that we can't support you "
"with configuration of your specific third party tool."
msgstr ""
"Tento návod předpokládá, že všechny požadované součásti jsou nainstalované a "
"běží. Základní konfiguraci jednotlivých nástrojů zde nepopisujeme. Vezměte "
"také prosím na vědomí, že vám nemůžeme pomoci s konfigurací konkrétního "
"nástroje třetí strany."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/reporting-grafana.md:29
msgid "You need:"
msgstr "Budete potřebovat:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/reporting-grafana.md:34
msgid ""
"A running instance of Grafana (hosted or self-hosted) in version 10.3 or "
"higher"
msgstr ""
"Běžící instanci Grafany (hostovanou nebo na vlastním serveru) ve verzi 10.3 "
"nebo vyšší"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/reporting-grafana.md:34
msgid "Read access to your Elasticsearch index"
msgstr "Přístup pro čtení k indexu Elasticsearch"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/reporting-grafana.md:34
msgid "A Zammad instance in version 4 or higher"
msgstr "Instanci Zammadu ve verzi 4 nebo vyšší"

#. type: Fenced div block (warning)
#: src/en/tutorials/reporting-grafana.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Never expose Elasticsearch to the public if you're not sure how\n"
"to do it. Especially **never** without authentication! Zammad\n"
"stores **very sensitive** information within the Elasticsearch\n"
"Index.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nikdy nezpřístupňujte Elasticsearch veřejně, pokud si nejste jisti, jak\n"
"to udělat. Zejména **nikdy** bez autentizace! Zammad\n"
"ukládá do indexu Elasticsearch **velmi citlivé**\n"
"informace.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/reporting-grafana.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting up required data sources"
msgstr "Nastavení potřebných zdrojů dat"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/reporting-grafana.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Before we start:** The data sources always follow the same scheme. We\n"
"reduced below information to `name`, `time field name` and `index name`.\n"
"Everything else relies on your environment and is out of our scope.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Než začneme:** Zdroje dat se vždy řídí stejným schématem. Níže\n"
"uvedené informace jsme omezili na `name`, `time field name` a `index name`.\n"
"Vše ostatní závisí na vašem prostředí a přesahuje rámec tohoto návodu.\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/reporting-grafana.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Replace `zammad_production_` with your fitting prefix.\n"
"\n"
"Click on details to see how to query the index.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Nahraďte `zammad_production_` prefixem, který odpovídá vašemu prostředí.\n"
"\n"
"Kliknutím na podrobnosti zjistíte, jak index dotazovat.\n"
