#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:161
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Remove NGINX, set up Apache + Kerberos"
msgstr "Krok 2: Odeberte NGINX, nastavte Apache + Kerberos"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:165
msgid ""
"Next, the Zammad host must be configured to support Kerberos (and to accept "
"auth credentials provided by the Active Directory server)."
msgstr ""
"Dále je třeba nakonfigurovat hostitele Zammadu tak, aby podporoval Kerberos "
"(a přijímal ověřovací údaje poskytnuté serverem Active Directory)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:169
msgid ""
"In most cases, you would have to recompile NGINX from source with an extra "
"module to enable Kerberos support. To get around this, we will use Apache, "
"which offers Kerberos support through a plug-in module instead."
msgstr ""
"Ve většině případů byste museli NGINX znovu zkompilovat ze zdrojového kódu s "
"dalším modulem, aby podporoval Kerberos. Abychom se tomu vyhnuli, použijeme "
"Apache, který podporu Kerberosu nabízí prostřednictvím zásuvného modulu."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:170
#, no-wrap
msgid "All commands in this section must be run as root (or with `sudo`).\n"
msgstr "Všechny příkazy v této části je nutné spouštět jako root (nebo pomocí `sudo`).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:174
#, no-wrap
msgid "2a. Turn off NGINX"
msgstr "2a. Vypněte NGINX"

#. type: Fenced div block (warning)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:176
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This will take your Zammad instance **offline** until Apache is fully\n"
"configured and running.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tím bude vaše instance Zammadu **offline**, dokud nebude Apache plně\n"
"nakonfigurován a spuštěn.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:182
msgid "Turn off Nginx:"
msgstr "Vypněte Nginx:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:183
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl stop nginx\n"
msgstr "sudo systemctl stop nginx\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:188
msgid "Keep it off after reboot:"
msgstr "Zajistěte, aby zůstal vypnutý i po restartu:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:189
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl disable nginx\n"
msgstr "sudo systemctl disable nginx\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:196
msgid ""
"If you wish to minimize downtime, you can save this step for last; just bear "
"in mind that Apache will not start if the port it wants to listen on is "
"being used by NGINX."
msgstr ""
"Pokud chcete minimalizovat výpadek, můžete tento krok nechat až na konec. "
"Mějte ale na paměti, že Apache se nespustí, pokud port, na kterém chce "
"naslouchat, používá NGINX."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:199
msgid ""
"If you can't complete this tutorial for any reason, simply turn off Apache "
"and restore NGINX:"
msgstr ""
"Pokud z jakéhokoli důvodu nemůžete tento návod dokončit, jednoduše vypněte "
"Apache a obnovte NGINX:"

#. type: Fenced div block (details)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:200
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl stop apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl disable apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl enable nginx\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl start nginx\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl stop apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl disable apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl enable nginx\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl start nginx\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:220
#, no-wrap
msgid "2b. Pre-configure Apache"
msgstr "2b. Předběžně nakonfigurujte Apache"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:226
msgid ""
"This documentation expects an already working Apache configuration.  You "
"should have a look at the [webserver configuration guide](/en/tutorials/"
"webserver-config) before continuing."
msgstr ""
"Tato dokumentace předpokládá již funkční konfiguraci Apache. Než budete "
"pokračovat, projděte si [návod ke konfiguraci webového serveru](/cs/"
"tutorials/webserver-config)."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:227
#, no-wrap
msgid "2c. Install further Apache dependencies"
msgstr "2c. Nainstalujte další závislosti pro Apache"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:229
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install krb5-user libapache2-mod-auth-gssapi\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo yum install krb5-workstation mod_auth_kerb\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper ref\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper install krb5-client apache2-mod_auth_kerb\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install krb5-user libapache2-mod-auth-gssapi\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo yum install krb5-workstation mod_auth_kerb\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper ref\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper install krb5-client apache2-mod_auth_kerb\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:259
#, no-wrap
msgid "2d. Enable Apache modules"
msgstr "2d. Zapněte moduly Apache"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:263
msgid ""
"SSO requires modules that are not enabled by default. By default you can use "
"`a2enmod` to do so."
msgstr ""
"SSO vyžaduje moduly, které nejsou ve výchozím stavu zapnuté. Obvykle k tomu "
"můžete použít `a2enmod`."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:264
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== a2enmod (Debian & Ubuntu)\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2enmod auth_gssapi rewrite\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== a2enmod (OpenSUSE)\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2enmod auth_kerb rewrite\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== via configuration file (CentOS)\n"
"\n"
"add/uncomment the appropriate `LoadModule` statements in your Apache\n"
"config:\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"# /etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf\n"
"\n"
"LoadModule auth_kerb_module /usr/lib/apache2/modules/mod_auth_kerb.so\n"
"LoadModule rewrite_module modules/mod_rewrite.so\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== a2enmod (Debian & Ubuntu)\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2enmod auth_gssapi rewrite\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== a2enmod (OpenSUSE)\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2enmod auth_kerb rewrite\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== pomocí konfiguračního souboru (CentOS)\n"
"\n"
"přidejte (nebo odkomentujte) příslušné příkazy `LoadModule` v konfiguraci\n"
"Apache:\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"# /etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf\n"
"\n"
"LoadModule auth_kerb_module /usr/lib/apache2/modules/mod_auth_kerb.so\n"
"LoadModule rewrite_module modules/mod_rewrite.so\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:300
#, no-wrap
msgid "2e. Configure Kerberos"
msgstr "2e. Nakonfigurujte Kerberos"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:304
msgid ""
"Kerberos realm configuration is how you tell the Zammad server how to reach "
"the _domain controller_ (Active Directory server)."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurací realmu Kerberos sdělíte serveru Zammadu, jak se spojit s "
"_řadičem domény_ (serverem Active Directory)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:306
msgid "Replace the following placeholders in the sample config below:"
msgstr ""
"V níže uvedené ukázkové konfiguraci nahraďte následující zástupné hodnoty:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:311
msgid "`<domain-controller>`: Domain controller IP/FQDN(s)"
msgstr "`<domain-controller>`: IP/FQDN řadiče (řadičů) domény"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:311
msgid ""
"`<master-domain-controller>`: Master domain controller IP/FQDN (must not be "
"read-only, but can be the same as `<domain-controller>`)"
msgstr ""
"`<master-domain-controller>`: IP/FQDN hlavního řadiče domény (nesmí být jen "
"pro čtení, ale může být stejný jako `<domain-controller>`)"

#. type: Fenced code block (ini)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:312
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# /etc/krb5.conf\n"
"\n"
"[libdefaults]\n"
"   default_realm = <DOMAIN>\n"
"\n"
"   default_tkt_enctypes = aes256-cts-hmac-sha1-96\n"
"   default_tgs_enctypes = aes256-cts-hmac-sha1-96\n"
"   permitted_enctypes = aes256-cts-hmac-sha1-96\n"
"\n"
"   kdc_timesync = 1\n"
"   ccache_type = 4\n"
"   forwardable = false\n"
"   proxiable = false\n"
"   fcc-mit-ticketflags = false\n"
"\n"
"[realms]\n"
"         # multiple KDCs ok (one `kdc = ...` definition per line)\n"
"         <DOMAIN> = {\n"
"                  kdc = <domain-controller>\n"
"                  admin_server = <master-domain-controller>\n"
"                  default_domain = <domain>\n"
"\n"
"                  # below is only for GSSAPI\n"
"                  auth_to_local = RULE:[1:$1@$0](.*@<domain>)s/@<domain>$//\n"
"                  auth_to_local = DEFAULT\n"
"         }\n"
"\n"
"[domain_realm]\n"
"         .<domain> = <DOMAIN>\n"
"         <domain> = <DOMAIN>\n"
msgstr ""
"# /etc/krb5.conf\n"
"\n"
"[libdefaults]\n"
"   default_realm = <DOMAIN>\n"
"\n"
"   default_tkt_enctypes = aes256-cts-hmac-sha1-96\n"
"   default_tgs_enctypes = aes256-cts-hmac-sha1-96\n"
"   permitted_enctypes = aes256-cts-hmac-sha1-96\n"
"\n"
"   kdc_timesync = 1\n"
"   ccache_type = 4\n"
"   forwardable = false\n"
"   proxiable = false\n"
"   fcc-mit-ticketflags = false\n"
"\n"
"[realms]\n"
"         # multiple KDCs ok (one `kdc = ...` definition per line)\n"
"         <DOMAIN> = {\n"
"                  kdc = <domain-controller>\n"
"                  admin_server = <master-domain-controller>\n"
"                  default_domain = <domain>\n"
"\n"
"                  # below is only for GSSAPI\n"
"                  auth_to_local = RULE:[1:$1@$0](.*@<domain>)s/@<domain>$//\n"
"                  auth_to_local = DEFAULT\n"
"         }\n"
"\n"
"[domain_realm]\n"
"         .<domain> = <DOMAIN>\n"
"         <domain> = <DOMAIN>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:345
#, no-wrap
msgid "2f. Generate keytab"
msgstr "2f. Vygenerujte keytab"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:349
msgid ""
"Apache needs a Kerberos _keytab_ (key table) to manage its shared secrets "
"with the domain controller."
msgstr ""
"Apache potřebuje Kerberos _keytab_ (tabulku klíčů), aby mohl spravovat "
"sdílená tajemství s řadičem domény."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:356
msgid "`<secret-key>`: Secret key (**omit the leading** `0x`)"
msgstr "`<secret-key>`: tajný klíč (**vynechte úvodní** `0x`)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:356
msgid "`<vno>`: Secret key version number"
msgstr "`<vno>`: číslo verze tajného klíče"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:359
msgid ""
"The secret key and version number were found in `sso-register-spn` (Step "
"1d)  above."
msgstr ""
"Tajný klíč a číslo verze jste získali v `sso-register-spn` (krok 1d) výše."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:361
msgid "Enter ktutil:"
msgstr "Spusťte ktutil:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:362
#, no-wrap
msgid "ktutil\n"
msgstr "ktutil\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:367
msgid "Add keytab:"
msgstr "Přidejte keytab:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:368
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ktutil: addent -key -p HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN> -k <vno> -e aes256-cts\n"
"Key for HTTP/<zammad-host>@<domain> (hex): <secret-key>\n"
msgstr ""
"ktutil: addent -key -p HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN> -k <vno> -e aes256-cts\n"
"Key for HTTP/<zammad-host>@<domain> (hex): <secret-key>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:374
msgid "Confirm the entry was added successfully:"
msgstr "Ověřte, že byl záznam úspěšně přidán:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:375
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ktutil: list\n"
"slot KVNO Principal\n"
"---- ---- ---------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"   1    3 HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>\n"
msgstr ""
"ktutil: list\n"
"slot KVNO Principal\n"
"---- ---- ---------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"   1    3 HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:383
msgid "Write keytab to disk:"
msgstr "Zapište keytab na disk:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:384
#, no-wrap
msgid "ktutil: wkt /root/zammad.keytab\n"
msgstr "ktutil: wkt /root/zammad.keytab\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:389
msgid "Leave ktutil:"
msgstr "Ukončete ktutil:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:390
#, no-wrap
msgid "ktutil: quit\n"
msgstr "ktutil: quit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:396
msgid ""
"Then, place the keytab in the Apache config directory and set the "
"appropriate permissions:"
msgstr ""
"Poté přesuňte keytab do konfiguračního adresáře Apache a nastavte příslušná "
"oprávnění:"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:397
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Debian, Ubuntu, OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo mv /root/zammad.keytab /etc/apache2/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chown root:www-data /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chmod 640 /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo mv /root/zammad.keytab /etc/httpd/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chown root:apache /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chmod 640 /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Debian, Ubuntu, OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo mv /root/zammad.keytab /etc/apache2/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chown root:www-data /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chmod 640 /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo mv /root/zammad.keytab /etc/httpd/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chown root:apache /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chmod 640 /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:429
#, no-wrap
msgid "2g. Configure Apache"
msgstr "2g. Nakonfigurujte Apache"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:433
msgid ""
"Add the following directive to the end of the virtual host configuration "
"file to create your Kerberos SSO endpoint at `/auth/sso`:"
msgstr ""
"Na konec konfiguračního souboru virtuálního hostitele přidejte následující "
"direktivu, která vytvoří koncový bod Kerberos SSO na `/auth/sso`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:435
msgid "Replace the following placeholders in the command below:"
msgstr "V níže uvedeném příkazu nahraďte následující zástupné hodnoty:"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:439
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"``` apache\n"
"# /etc/apache2/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"\n"
"<LocationMatch \"/auth/sso\">\n"
"   SSLRequireSSL\n"
"   AuthType GSSAPI\n"
"   AuthName \"Your Zammad\"\n"
"   GssapiBasicAuth On\n"
"   GssapiCredStore keytab:/etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"   GssapiLocalName On\n"
"   require valid-user\n"
"\n"
"   RewriteEngine On\n"
"   RewriteCond %{LA-U:REMOTE_USER} (.+)\n"
"   RewriteRule . - [E=RU:%1,NS]\n"
"   RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-User \"%{RU}e\" env=RU\n"
"</LocationMatch>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS & OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"The configuration for CentOS and OpenSUSE below contains two\n"
"`Krb5KeyTab` lines! Keep only the one you need.\n"
"\n"
"``` apache\n"
"# /etc/apache2/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"\n"
"<LocationMatch \"/auth/sso\">\n"
"   SSLRequireSSL\n"
"   AuthType Kerberos\n"
"   AuthName \"Your Zammad\"\n"
"   KrbMethodNegotiate On\n"
"   KrbVerifyKDC On\n"
"   KrbMethodK5Passwd On\n"
"   KrbAuthRealms <DOMAIN>\n"
"   KrbLocalUserMapping on                 # strips @REALM suffix from REMOTE_USER variable\n"
"   KrbServiceName HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>\n"
"   Krb5KeyTab /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab  # Ubuntu, Debian, & openSUSE\n"
"   Krb5KeyTab /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab    # CentOS\n"
"   require valid-user\n"
"\n"
"   RewriteEngine On\n"
"   RewriteCond %{LA-U:REMOTE_USER} (.+)\n"
"   RewriteRule . - [E=RU:%1,NS]\n"
"   RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-User \"%{RU}e\" env=RU\n"
"</LocationMatch>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"``` apache\n"
"# /etc/apache2/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"\n"
"<LocationMatch \"/auth/sso\">\n"
"   SSLRequireSSL\n"
"   AuthType GSSAPI\n"
"   AuthName \"Your Zammad\"\n"
"   GssapiBasicAuth On\n"
"   GssapiCredStore keytab:/etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"   GssapiLocalName On\n"
"   require valid-user\n"
"\n"
"   RewriteEngine On\n"
"   RewriteCond %{LA-U:REMOTE_USER} (.+)\n"
"   RewriteRule . - [E=RU:%1,NS]\n"
"   RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-User \"%{RU}e\" env=RU\n"
"</LocationMatch>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS & OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"Níže uvedená konfigurace pro CentOS a OpenSUSE obsahuje dva\n"
"řádky `Krb5KeyTab`! Ponechte jen ten, který potřebujete.\n"
"\n"
"``` apache\n"
"# /etc/apache2/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"\n"
"<LocationMatch \"/auth/sso\">\n"
"   SSLRequireSSL\n"
"   AuthType Kerberos\n"
"   AuthName \"Your Zammad\"\n"
"   KrbMethodNegotiate On\n"
"   KrbVerifyKDC On\n"
"   KrbMethodK5Passwd On\n"
"   KrbAuthRealms <DOMAIN>\n"
"   KrbLocalUserMapping on                 # strips @REALM suffix from REMOTE_USER variable\n"
"   KrbServiceName HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>\n"
"   Krb5KeyTab /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab  # Ubuntu, Debian, & openSUSE\n"
"   Krb5KeyTab /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab    # CentOS\n"
"   require valid-user\n"
"\n"
"   RewriteEngine On\n"
"   RewriteCond %{LA-U:REMOTE_USER} (.+)\n"
"   RewriteRule . - [E=RU:%1,NS]\n"
"   RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-User \"%{RU}e\" env=RU\n"
"</LocationMatch>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:493
#, no-wrap
msgid "2g. Restart Apache to apply changes"
msgstr "2g. Restartujte Apache, aby se změny projevily"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:495
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
msgstr "sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:499
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Enable SSO in Zammad"
msgstr "Krok 3: Zapněte SSO v Zammadu"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:503
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, enable \"Authentication via SSO\" in Zammad's admin interface under\n"
"_Settings > Security > Third-party Applications_\n"
msgstr ""
"Dále zapněte \"Autentizace pomocí SSO\" v administraci Zammadu v sekci\n"
"_Nastavení > Zabezpečení > Aplikace třetích stran_\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:504
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On older versions of Zammad, visit `https://your.zammad.host/auth/sso`\n"
"to sign in.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ve starších verzích Zammadu se přihlaste na adrese\n"
"`https://your.zammad.host/auth/sso`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:509
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Configure client system (Windows only)"
msgstr "Krok 4: Nakonfigurujte klientský systém (pouze Windows)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:513
msgid ""
"For the full SSO experience (i.e. for passwordless one-click sign-in), "
"Zammad users must:"
msgstr ""
"Pro plnohodnotné SSO (tj. přihlášení jedním kliknutím bez hesla) musí "
"uživatelé Zammadu:"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:517
msgid "be on the Active Directory server's local intranet; and"
msgstr "být v místním intranetu serveru Active Directory a"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:517
msgid ""
"modify their network settings for the Zammad host to be treated as a local "
"intranet server."
msgstr ""
"upravit svá síťová nastavení tak, aby byl hostitel Zammadu považován za "
"server místního intranetu."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:520
msgid ""
"Without this step, users must enter their Active Directory credentials "
"during SSO."
msgstr ""
"Bez tohoto kroku musí uživatelé při SSO zadávat své přihlašovací údaje k "
"Active Directory."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:521
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== IE / Edge / Chromium\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== IE / Edge / Chromium\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs|tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:521
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This setting can be centrally managed across the entire intranet using\n"
"a **group policy object** (GPO).\n"
msgstr ""
"Toto nastavení lze centrálně spravovat v celém intranetu pomocí\n"
"**objektu zásad skupiny** (GPO).\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs|tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:521
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"1. Add your Zammad FQDN in Internet Options under _Security > Local\n"
"   Intranet > Sites > Advanced_.\n"
"2. Select \"Require server verification (https:) for all sites in this\n"
"   zone\".\n"
"3. Under _Security level for this zone > Custom level... > Settings\n"
"   \\> User Authentication > Logon_, select \"Automatic logon only in\n"
"   Intranet Zone\".\n"
"\n"
"=== Firefox\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"1. Přidejte FQDN Zammadu v Internet Options v části _Security > Local\n"
"   Intranet > Sites > Advanced_.\n"
"2. Zapněte volbu \"Require server verification (https:) for all sites in this\n"
"   zone\".\n"
"3. V části _Security level for this zone > Custom level... > Settings\n"
"   \\> User Authentication > Logon_ vyberte \"Automatic logon only in\n"
"   Intranet Zone\".\n"
"\n"
"=== Firefox\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs|info)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:521
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This option cannot be centrally managed because it is set in the\n"
"browser rather than Windows Settings.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tuto možnost nelze spravovat centrálně, protože se nastavuje\n"
"v prohlížeči, nikoli v nastavení Windows.\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:521
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"1. Enter `about:config` in the address bar. Click **Accept the risk and\n"
"   continue**.\n"
"2. Search for the `network.negotiate-auth.trusted-uris` option.\n"
"3. Double-click to edit, then add your Zammad FQDN.\n"
"4. Restart Firefox to apply your changes.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"1. Do adresního řádku zadejte `about:config`. Klikněte na **Accept the risk and\n"
"   continue**.\n"
"2. Vyhledejte volbu `network.negotiate-auth.trusted-uris`.\n"
"3. Dvojitým kliknutím ji upravte a přidejte FQDN Zammadu.\n"
"4. Restartujte Firefox, aby se změny projevily.\n"
"\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:560
msgid ""
"Are all relevant FQDNs/hostnames reachable from your Active Directory and "
"Zammad servers (including each other's)?"
msgstr ""
"Jsou všechny relevantní FQDN/názvy hostitelů dostupné ze serverů Active "
"Directory a Zammadu (a to i vzájemně mezi sebou)?"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:560
msgid ""
"Are the system clocks of your Active Directory and Zammad servers "
"synchronized within five minutes of each other? Kerberos is a time-sensitive "
"protocol!"
msgstr ""
"Liší se systémové hodiny serverů Active Directory a Zammadu nejvýše o pět "
"minut? Kerberos je protokol citlivý na čas!"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:561
#, no-wrap
msgid "Errors in Apache logs"
msgstr "Chyby v logech Apache"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:563
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Try raising your Apache log level temporarily.**\n"
"\n"
"Add `LogLevel debug` to your virtual host configuration, then restart\n"
"the service to apply the changes.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Zkuste dočasně zvýšit úroveň logování Apache.**\n"
"\n"
"Přidejte `LogLevel debug` do konfigurace virtuálního hostitele a poté\n"
"službu restartujte, aby se změny projevily.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:570
#, no-wrap
msgid "An unsupported mechanism was requested"
msgstr "An unsupported mechanism was requested"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:574
msgid ""
"Does your Active Directory service account have **Kerberos AES 256-bit "
"encryption** enabled?"
msgstr ""
"Má účet služby v Active Directory zapnuté **256bitové šifrování Kerberos "
"AES**?"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:578
msgid ""
"If for some reason your server does not support AES 256-bit encryption, the "
"LDAP Wiki has [more information about Kerberos encryption types](https://"
"ldapwiki.com/wiki/MsDS-SupportedEncryptionTypes){target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"Pokud váš server z nějakého důvodu nepodporuje 256bitové šifrování AES, "
"najdete na LDAP Wiki [další informace o typech šifrování Kerberos](https://"
"ldapwiki.com/wiki/MsDS-SupportedEncryptionTypes){target=_blank}."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:579
#, no-wrap
msgid "Failed to verify krb5 credentials: Key version is not available"
msgstr "Failed to verify krb5 credentials: Key version is not available"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:583
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Did you use the exact **version number** (`vno`) provided by `ktpass`\n"
"when `generating your keytab <sso-generate-keytab>`?\n"
msgstr ""
"Použili jste přesné **číslo verze** (`vno`) z výstupu `ktpass`\n"
"při `generating your keytab <sso-generate-keytab>`?\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:585 src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:592
msgid "Try generating it again, just to be sure."
msgstr "Pro jistotu ho zkuste vygenerovat znovu."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:586
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unspecified GSS failure. Minor code may provide more information (, no key table entry found for HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN)"
msgstr "Unspecified GSS failure. Minor code may provide more information (, no key table entry found for HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:590
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Does the **service name** you provided to `setspn` exactly match the one\n"
"you used when `generating your keytab <sso-generate-keytab>`?\n"
msgstr ""
"Odpovídá **název služby**, který jste zadali do `setspn`, přesně tomu,\n"
"který jste použili při `generating your keytab <sso-generate-keytab>`?\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:593
#, no-wrap
msgid "No key table entry found for HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN"
msgstr "No key table entry found for HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:597
msgid ""
"Does your virtual host configuration's `KrbServiceName` setting exactly "
"match the **service name** you provided to `setspn`?"
msgstr ""
"Odpovídá nastavení `KrbServiceName` v konfiguraci virtuálního hostitele "
"přesně **názvu služby**, který jste zadali do `setspn`?"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:599
msgid "This setting is case-sensitive."
msgstr "Toto nastavení rozlišuje velká a malá písmena."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:600
#, no-wrap
msgid "Warning: Received token seems to be NTLM, which isn't supported by the Kerberos module. Check your IE configuration"
msgstr "Warning: Received token seems to be NTLM, which isn't supported by the Kerberos module. Check your IE configuration"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:604
msgid ""
"Is your Zammad host accessible at an FQDN? This error may indicate that you "
"configured your Zammad host as a numeric IP address instead."
msgstr ""
"Je hostitel Zammadu dostupný přes FQDN? Tato chyba může znamenat, že jste "
"hostitele Zammadu nakonfigurovali s číselnou IP adresou."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:605
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cannot decrypt ticket for HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN"
msgstr "Cannot decrypt ticket for HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:609
msgid ""
"Did you make sure to change the password on your Active Directory service "
"account _after enabling 256-bit AES encryption?_"
msgstr ""
"Změnili jste heslo účtu služby v Active Directory _až po zapnutí 256bitového "
"šifrování AES?_"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:612
msgid ""
"And did you make sure to register the SPN (with `ktpass`) and generate your "
"keytab (with `ktutil`) _after changing your password?_"
msgstr ""
"A zaregistrovali jste SPN (pomocí `ktpass`) a vygenerovali keytab (pomocí "
"`ktutil`) _až po změně hesla?_"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:618
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Try running `kinit -k -t <path to keytab> HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>`.\n"
"If no output is returned, you're good - if you see \"kinit:\n"
"Preauthentication failed while getting initial credentials\" your\n"
"credentials provided were wrong or you used `/pass *` during ktpass\n"
"command.\n"
msgstr ""
"Zkuste spustit `kinit -k -t <path to keytab> HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>`.\n"
"Pokud se nevypíše nic, je vše v pořádku. Pokud uvidíte \"kinit:\n"
"Preauthentication failed while getting initial credentials\", byly\n"
"zadané přihlašovací údaje chybné nebo jste u příkazu ktpass použili\n"
"`/pass *`.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:619
#, no-wrap
msgid "Failed when verifying KDC\" and \"failed to verify krb5 credentials: Decrypt integrity check failed"
msgstr "Failed when verifying KDC\" and \"failed to verify krb5 credentials: Decrypt integrity check failed"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:622
msgid "Ensure `KrbServiceName` is the correct ServiceName provided via setspn."
msgstr ""
"Ujistěte se, že `KrbServiceName` je správný název služby (ServiceName) "
"zadaný pomocí setspn."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:624
msgid "Ensure your Active Directory supports the encryption method configured."
msgstr ""
"Ujistěte se, že vaše Active Directory podporuje nakonfigurovanou metodu "
"šifrování."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:627
msgid ""
"If all above is correct and the rest of FAQ also is ensured, make sure your "
"client does not cache the results. `klist purge` clears the clients cache - "
"a reboot of your client would do too."
msgstr ""
"Pokud je vše výše uvedené v pořádku a splněny jsou i ostatní body těchto "
"častých dotazů, ujistěte se, že klient neukládá výsledky do mezipaměti. "
"`klist purge` vymaže mezipaměť klienta – stejně tak poslouží restart klienta."

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Webserver configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurace webového serveru"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:13
msgid ""
"Configure your webserver to reverse-proxy the Zammad application server.  "
"This guide covers obtaining an SSL certificate, adjusting the sample "
"configuration for Nginx and Apache 2 and reloading the webserver to apply "
"the changes."
msgstr ""
"Nakonfigurujte webový server jako reverzní proxy pro aplikační server "
"Zammadu. Tento návod popisuje získání SSL certifikátu, úpravu ukázkové "
"konfigurace pro Nginx a Apache 2 a opětovné načtení webového serveru, aby se "
"změny projevily."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:22
msgid ""
"You can find sample configuration files for your webserver within the "
"`contrib/` directory of your Zammad installation. There are two example "
"files per webserver: `zammad.conf` (plain HTTP) and `zammad_ssl.conf` "
"(HTTPS). The non-SSL file is intended for local testing only and must not be "
"used in production. During a package installation of Zammad, the package "
"automatically copies the non-SSL `zammad.conf` to your webserver's config "
"directory. For production use, replace it with `zammad_ssl.conf` and follow "
"the steps on this page."
msgstr ""
"Ukázkové konfigurační soubory pro webový server najdete v adresáři `contrib/"
"` vaší instalace Zammadu. Pro každý webový server jsou k dispozici dva "
"ukázkové soubory: `zammad.conf` (čisté HTTP) a `zammad_ssl.conf` (HTTPS). "
"Soubor bez SSL je určen pouze pro místní testování a nesmí se používat v "
"produkci. Při instalaci Zammadu z balíčku balíček automaticky zkopíruje "
"soubor `zammad.conf` bez SSL do konfiguračního adresáře webového serveru. "
"Pro produkční použití ho nahraďte souborem `zammad_ssl.conf` a postupujte "
"podle kroků na této stránce."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Docker Compose / Kubernetes users:**\n"
"\n"
"Skip this page. Configure the webserver port, hostname and scheme via the\n"
"`NGINX_*` and `ZAMMAD_RAILSSERVER_*` variables on the\n"
"[environment variables page](/en/reference/environment-variables).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Uživatelé Docker Compose / Kubernetes:**\n"
"\n"
"Tuto stránku přeskočte. Port, název hostitele a schéma webového serveru nastavíte\n"
"pomocí proměnných `NGINX_*` a `ZAMMAD_RAILSSERVER_*` na\n"
"[stránce s proměnnými prostředí](/cs/reference/environment-variables).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Obtain an SSL certificate"
msgstr "Získání SSL certifikátu"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:35
msgid ""
"Zammad requires HTTPS in production. Use one of the options below to obtain "
"a certificate before continuing with the webserver configuration."
msgstr ""
"Zammad v produkci vyžaduje HTTPS. Než budete pokračovat s konfigurací "
"webového serveru, získejte certifikát jedním z níže uvedených způsobů."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Commercial certificate authority"
msgstr "Komerční certifikační autorita"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:45
msgid ""
"Buy an annual certificate from any trusted public CA. A few common options "
"are [Sectigo](https://sectigo.com/ssl-certificates-tls){target=_blank}, "
"[GlobalSign](https://www.globalsign.com/en/managed-ssl){target=_blank} or "
"[DigiCert](https://www.digicert.com/tls-ssl/){target=_blank}. Install the "
"resulting certificate, key and chain on your server as you would for any "
"HTTPS service, then continue with the webserver configuration below."
msgstr ""
"Zakupte roční certifikát od kterékoli důvěryhodné veřejné CA. Mezi běžné "
"možnosti patří [Sectigo](https://sectigo.com/ssl-certificates-tls)"
"{target=_blank}, [GlobalSign](https://www.globalsign.com/en/managed-ssl)"
"{target=_blank} nebo [DigiCert](https://www.digicert.com/tls-ssl/)"
"{target=_blank}. Získaný certifikát, klíč a řetězec nainstalujte na server "
"stejně jako u jakékoli jiné služby HTTPS a poté pokračujte níže konfigurací "
"webového serveru."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let's Encrypt"
msgstr "Let's Encrypt"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:50
msgid ""
"Let's Encrypt issues free, automatically renewable certificates. Two clients "
"are commonly used."
msgstr ""
"Let's Encrypt vydává bezplatné certifikáty s automatickým obnovováním. Běžně "
"se používají dva klienti."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:51
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Certbot\n"
"\n"
"Certbot is the most widely used ACME client. Follow the upstream\n"
"[Certbot installation instructions](https://certbot.eff.org/instructions){target=_blank},\n"
"select your distribution and the matching webserver plugin in the\n"
"selector and complete the install. Once installed, request a certificate\n"
"by replacing `<webserver>` with `nginx` or `apache` and\n"
"`zammad.example.com` with your subdomain:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo certbot --<webserver> -d zammad.example.com\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Certbot will issue the certificate, ask whether to redirect HTTP to HTTPS\n"
"(choose `[1] not redirect` if you plan to use the Zammad sample\n"
"configuration, which already handles the redirect, otherwise choose\n"
"`[2] redirect`) and arrange automatic renewal once the certificate has\n"
"less than 30 days of validity remaining.\n"
"\n"
"=== acme.sh\n"
"\n"
"[acme.sh](https://github.com/acmesh-official/acme.sh){target=_blank} is\n"
"a lightweight shell-based ACME client and an alternative to Certbot, but\n"
"it no longer uses Let's Encrypt by default. Set the default CA to Let's\n"
"Encrypt before issuing a certificate:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --set-default-ca --server letsencrypt\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Issue the certificate by replacing `<webserver-plugin>` with `nginx`,\n"
"`apache` or `standalone` and `zammad.example.com` with your subdomain:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --issue --<webserver-plugin> -d zammad.example.com\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Install the certificate to a directory of your choice (e.g.\n"
"`/etc/ssl/private/`) and reload the webserver after each renewal.\n"
"Replace `<webserver-service>` in the command below with the matching\n"
"systemd service name (`nginx`, `apache2` or `httpd`):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --install-cert -d zammad.example.com \\\n"
"    --cert-file      /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.pem  \\\n"
"    --key-file       /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.key  \\\n"
"    --fullchain-file /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.full.pem \\\n"
"    --reloadcmd     \"sudo systemctl force-reload <webserver-service>\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"See the\n"
"[acme.sh documentation](https://github.com/acmesh-official/acme.sh/wiki/How-to-issue-a-cert){target=_blank}\n"
"for further use cases.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Certbot\n"
"\n"
"Certbot je nejrozšířenější klient ACME. Postupujte podle oficiálního\n"
"[návodu k instalaci Certbotu](https://certbot.eff.org/instructions){target=_blank},\n"
"ve výběru zvolte svou distribuci a odpovídající plugin webového serveru\n"
"a dokončete instalaci. Po instalaci si vyžádejte certifikát,\n"
"přičemž `<webserver>` nahraďte hodnotou `nginx` nebo `apache` a\n"
"`zammad.example.com` svou subdoménou:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo certbot --<webserver> -d zammad.example.com\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Certbot vydá certifikát, zeptá se, zda přesměrovat HTTP na HTTPS\n"
"(zvolte `[1] not redirect`, pokud plánujete použít ukázkovou konfiguraci\n"
"Zammadu, která přesměrování již řeší, jinak zvolte\n"
"`[2] redirect`) a zajistí automatické obnovení, jakmile certifikátu\n"
"zbývá méně než 30 dní platnosti.\n"
"\n"
"=== acme.sh\n"
"\n"
"[acme.sh](https://github.com/acmesh-official/acme.sh){target=_blank} je\n"
"odlehčený klient ACME založený na shellu a alternativa k Certbotu, ale\n"
"ve výchozím stavu již nepoužívá Let's Encrypt. Před vydáním certifikátu\n"
"nastavte jako výchozí CA Let's Encrypt:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --set-default-ca --server letsencrypt\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Vydejte certifikát, přičemž `<webserver-plugin>` nahraďte hodnotou `nginx`,\n"
"`apache` nebo `standalone` a `zammad.example.com` svou subdoménou:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --issue --<webserver-plugin> -d zammad.example.com\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Nainstalujte certifikát do zvoleného adresáře (např.\n"
"`/etc/ssl/private/`) a po každém obnovení znovu načtěte webový server.\n"
"V níže uvedeném příkazu nahraďte `<webserver-service>` odpovídajícím\n"
"názvem služby systemd (`nginx`, `apache2` nebo `httpd`):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --install-cert -d zammad.example.com \\\n"
"    --cert-file      /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.pem  \\\n"
"    --key-file       /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.key  \\\n"
"    --fullchain-file /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.full.pem \\\n"
"    --reloadcmd     \"sudo systemctl force-reload <webserver-service>\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Podívejte se do\n"
"[dokumentace acme.sh](https://github.com/acmesh-official/acme.sh/wiki/How-to-issue-a-cert){target=_blank}\n"
"– najdete tam další případy použití.\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the webserver configuration"
msgstr "Úprava konfigurace webového serveru"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "<!-- markdownlint-disable MD036 -->\n"
msgstr "<!-- markdownlint-disable MD036 -->\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:113
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Nginx (default)\n"
"\n"
"**Get the sample config into place**\n"
"\n"
"Copy the SSL sample configuration to your Nginx config directory:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo cp /opt/zammad/contrib/nginx/zammad_ssl.conf \\\n"
"    /etc/nginx/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Most common Nginx config directories:\n"
"\n"
"- `/etc/nginx/conf.d/`\n"
"- `/etc/nginx/vhosts.d/`\n"
"- `/etc/nginx/sites-available/`\n"
"\n"
"**Adjust server name and certificate paths**\n"
"\n"
"Adjust the just copied file with a text editor of your choice (e.g.\n"
"vi or nano). Locate both `server_name` directives (one in the HTTP\n"
"server block on port 80, one in the HTTPS server block on port 443)\n"
"and adjust `example.com` to the subdomain you have chosen for your\n"
"Zammad instance.\n"
"\n"
"Use the same domain as the fully qualified domain name in Zammad's\n"
"Base settings (_Settings > System > Base_). Zammad only accepts live\n"
"updates from that origin, so a differing server name breaks the real-time\n"
"channel.\n"
"\n"
"Now you'll need to adjust the path and file names for your SSL\n"
"certificates you obtained on the prior steps. Adjust the following\n"
"directives to match your setup:\n"
"\n"
"- `ssl_certificate` (your SSL certificate)\n"
"- `ssl_certificate_key` (the certificate's private key)\n"
"- `ssl_trusted_certificate` (the public CA certificate)\n"
"\n"
"To improve HTTPS security, also configure a Diffie-Hellman parameter\n"
"file and point `ssl_dhparam` at it:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo openssl dhparam -out /etc/ssl/dhparam.pem 4096\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"**Reload and verify**\n"
"\n"
"Verify the configuration:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo nginx -t\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Reload Nginx:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl reload nginx\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Apache 2\n"
"\n"
"**Enable the required modules**\n"
"\n"
"Zammad requires modules that are not enabled by default. On Ubuntu,\n"
"Debian and openSUSE use `a2enmod`:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo a2enmod proxy proxy_html proxy_http proxy_wstunnel headers ssl\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"For HTTP/2 support also enable:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo a2enmod h2 proxy_http2 mpm_event\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"On CentOS / RHEL add the matching `LoadModule` lines to\n"
"`/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf` instead:\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"LoadModule headers_module modules/mod_headers.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_module modules/mod_proxy.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_html_module modules/mod_proxy_html.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_http_module modules/mod_proxy_http.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_wstunnel_module modules/mod_proxy_wstunnel.so\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Restart Apache after enabling the modules:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"**Get the sample config into place**\n"
"\n"
"Copy the SSL sample configuration to your Apache config directory:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo cp /opt/zammad/contrib/apache2/zammad_ssl.conf \\\n"
"    /etc/apache2/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Most common Apache config directories:\n"
"\n"
"- `/etc/apache2/conf.d/`\n"
"- `/etc/httpd/vhosts.d/`\n"
"- `/etc/apache2/sites-available/`\n"
"\n"
"The package installation attempts to copy this file for you. Do not\n"
"rename it.\n"
"\n"
"**Adjust server name and certificate paths**\n"
"\n"
"Adjust the just copied file with a text editor of your choice (e.g.\n"
"vi or nano). Locate any `ServerName` directive and adjust `example.com`\n"
"to the subdomain you have chosen for your Zammad instance. The first\n"
"`ServerName` (in the HTTP VirtualHost) defaults to `example.com` and\n"
"the second (in the HTTPS VirtualHost) to `localhost`.\n"
"\n"
"Use the same domain as the fully qualified domain name in Zammad's\n"
"Base settings (_Settings > System > Base_). Zammad only accepts live\n"
"updates from that origin, so a differing server name breaks the real-time\n"
"channel.\n"
"\n"
"Now you'll need to adjust the path and file names for your SSL\n"
"certificates you obtained on the prior steps. Adjust the following\n"
"directives to match your setup:\n"
"\n"
"- `SSLCertificateFile` (your SSL certificate)\n"
"- `SSLCertificateKeyFile` (the certificate's private key)\n"
"- `SSLCertificateChainFile` (the public CA certificate)\n"
"\n"
"To improve HTTPS security, also configure a Diffie-Hellman parameter\n"
"file and point `SSLOpenSSLConfCmd DHParameters` at it:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo openssl dhparam -out /etc/ssl/dhparam.pem 4096\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"**Enable the site**\n"
"\n"
"On Ubuntu, Debian and openSUSE:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo a2ensite zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"On CentOS / RHEL:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo ln -s /etc/httpd/sites-available/zammad_ssl.conf /etc/httpd/sites-enabled/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Make sure `IncludeOptional sites-enabled/*.conf` is present in\n"
"`/etc/apache2/apache2.conf` (Ubuntu, Debian, openSUSE) or\n"
"`/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf` (CentOS / RHEL).\n"
"\n"
"**Reload and verify**\n"
"\n"
"Reload Apache and verify the configuration:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl reload apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Local testing or other proxy servers\n"
"\n"
"Zammad's main application listens on port `3000` and the WebSocket\n"
"server on port `6042`. If you put your own reverse proxy in front of\n"
"Zammad, forward both.\n"
"\n"
"If the default ports conflict with other applications on your host, see\n"
"the [environment variables page](/en/reference/environment-variables) to\n"
"change them.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Nginx (výchozí)\n"
"\n"
"**Umístění ukázkové konfigurace**\n"
"\n"
"Zkopírujte ukázkovou konfiguraci SSL do konfiguračního adresáře Nginx:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo cp /opt/zammad/contrib/nginx/zammad_ssl.conf \\\n"
"    /etc/nginx/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Nejběžnější konfigurační adresáře Nginx:\n"
"\n"
"- `/etc/nginx/conf.d/`\n"
"- `/etc/nginx/vhosts.d/`\n"
"- `/etc/nginx/sites-available/`\n"
"\n"
"**Úprava názvu serveru a cest k certifikátům**\n"
"\n"
"Právě zkopírovaný soubor upravte v libovolném textovém editoru (např.\n"
"vi nebo nano). Najděte obě direktivy `server_name` (jednu v bloku serveru\n"
"HTTP na portu 80, druhou v bloku serveru HTTPS na portu 443)\n"
"a změňte `example.com` na subdoménu, kterou jste zvolili pro svou\n"
"instanci Zammadu.\n"
"\n"
"Použijte stejnou doménu jako plně kvalifikovaný doménový název\n"
"v základním nastavení Zammadu (_Nastavení > Systém > Základní_).\n"
"Zammad přijímá aktualizace v reálném čase pouze z tohoto původu (origin),\n"
"takže odlišný název serveru naruší kanál pro aktualizace v reálném čase.\n"
"\n"
"Nyní je třeba upravit cesty a názvy souborů SSL certifikátů,\n"
"které jste získali v předchozích krocích. Upravte následující\n"
"direktivy podle svého prostředí:\n"
"\n"
"- `ssl_certificate` (váš SSL certifikát)\n"
"- `ssl_certificate_key` (soukromý klíč certifikátu)\n"
"- `ssl_trusted_certificate` (veřejný certifikát CA)\n"
"\n"
"Pro vyšší zabezpečení HTTPS nakonfigurujte také soubor s parametry\n"
"Diffie-Hellman a nasměrujte na něj `ssl_dhparam`:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo openssl dhparam -out /etc/ssl/dhparam.pem 4096\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"**Opětovné načtení a ověření**\n"
"\n"
"Ověřte konfiguraci:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo nginx -t\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Znovu načtěte Nginx:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl reload nginx\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Apache 2\n"
"\n"
"**Zapnutí potřebných modulů**\n"
"\n"
"Zammad vyžaduje moduly, které nejsou ve výchozím stavu zapnuté. V Ubuntu,\n"
"Debianu a openSUSE použijte `a2enmod`:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo a2enmod proxy proxy_html proxy_http proxy_wstunnel headers ssl\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Pro podporu HTTP/2 zapněte také:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo a2enmod h2 proxy_http2 mpm_event\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"V CentOS / RHEL místo toho přidejte odpovídající řádky `LoadModule` do\n"
"`/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf`:\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"LoadModule headers_module modules/mod_headers.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_module modules/mod_proxy.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_html_module modules/mod_proxy_html.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_http_module modules/mod_proxy_http.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_wstunnel_module modules/mod_proxy_wstunnel.so\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Po zapnutí modulů restartujte Apache:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"**Umístění ukázkové konfigurace**\n"
"\n"
"Zkopírujte ukázkovou konfiguraci SSL do konfiguračního adresáře Apache:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo cp /opt/zammad/contrib/apache2/zammad_ssl.conf \\\n"
"    /etc/apache2/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Nejběžnější konfigurační adresáře Apache:\n"
"\n"
"- `/etc/apache2/conf.d/`\n"
"- `/etc/httpd/vhosts.d/`\n"
"- `/etc/apache2/sites-available/`\n"
"\n"
"Instalace z balíčku se pokusí tento soubor zkopírovat za vás. Soubor\n"
"nepřejmenovávejte.\n"
"\n"
"**Úprava názvu serveru a cest k certifikátům**\n"
"\n"
"Právě zkopírovaný soubor upravte v libovolném textovém editoru (např.\n"
"vi nebo nano). Najděte všechny direktivy `ServerName` a změňte `example.com`\n"
"na subdoménu, kterou jste zvolili pro svou instanci Zammadu. První\n"
"`ServerName` (ve VirtualHost pro HTTP) má výchozí hodnotu `example.com` a\n"
"druhá (ve VirtualHost pro HTTPS) `localhost`.\n"
"\n"
"Použijte stejnou doménu jako plně kvalifikovaný doménový název\n"
"v základním nastavení Zammadu (_Nastavení > Systém > Základní_).\n"
"Zammad přijímá aktualizace v reálném čase pouze z tohoto původu (origin),\n"
"takže odlišný název serveru naruší kanál pro aktualizace v reálném čase.\n"
"\n"
"Nyní je třeba upravit cesty a názvy souborů SSL certifikátů,\n"
"které jste získali v předchozích krocích. Upravte následující\n"
"direktivy podle svého prostředí:\n"
"\n"
"- `SSLCertificateFile` (váš SSL certifikát)\n"
"- `SSLCertificateKeyFile` (soukromý klíč certifikátu)\n"
"- `SSLCertificateChainFile` (veřejný certifikát CA)\n"
"\n"
"Pro vyšší zabezpečení HTTPS nakonfigurujte také soubor s parametry\n"
"Diffie-Hellman a nasměrujte na něj `SSLOpenSSLConfCmd DHParameters`:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo openssl dhparam -out /etc/ssl/dhparam.pem 4096\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"**Zapnutí webu**\n"
"\n"
"V Ubuntu, Debianu a openSUSE:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo a2ensite zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"V CentOS / RHEL:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo ln -s /etc/httpd/sites-available/zammad_ssl.conf /etc/httpd/sites-enabled/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Ujistěte se, že `IncludeOptional sites-enabled/*.conf` je uvedeno v\n"
"`/etc/apache2/apache2.conf` (Ubuntu, Debian, openSUSE) nebo\n"
"`/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf` (CentOS / RHEL).\n"
"\n"
"**Opětovné načtení a ověření**\n"
"\n"
"Znovu načtěte Apache a ověřte konfiguraci:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl reload apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Místní testování nebo jiné proxy servery\n"
"\n"
"Hlavní aplikace Zammadu naslouchá na portu `3000` a server WebSocket\n"
"na portu `6042`. Pokud před Zammad umístíte vlastní reverzní proxy,\n"
"přesměrujte na oba.\n"
"\n"
"Pokud jsou výchozí porty v konfliktu s jinými aplikacemi na hostiteli,\n"
"na [stránce s proměnnými prostředí](/cs/reference/environment-variables) zjistíte,\n"
"jak je změnit.\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs|warning)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:113
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Do not expose Zammad directly to the internet. Zammad only provides\n"
"plain HTTP and would be reachable without authentication.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nezpřístupňujte Zammad přímo do internetu. Zammad poskytuje pouze\n"
"čisté HTTP a byl by dostupný bez autentizace.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:298
#, no-wrap
msgid "<!-- markdownlint-enable MD036 -->\n"
msgstr "<!-- markdownlint-enable MD036 -->\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:302
msgid ""
"Now visit your configured Zammad domain in a browser to reach the Zammad UI. "
"If you don't see Zammad's setup wizard or Zammad UI at all, check the "
"[Troubleshooting section](#troubleshooting) below."
msgstr ""
"Nyní v prohlížeči otevřete nakonfigurovanou doménu Zammadu a dostanete se do "
"rozhraní Zammadu. Pokud se nezobrazí průvodce nastavením Zammadu ani "
"rozhraní Zammadu, podívejte se do části [Řešení problémů](#reseni-problemu) "
"níže."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:305
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default landing page instead of Zammad"
msgstr "Místo Zammadu se zobrazuje výchozí úvodní stránka"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:311
msgid ""
"If you reach the webserver's default landing page rather than Zammad, your "
"`zammad.conf` may be overruled by another config file. Check the vhost "
"directory for `000-default.conf` or `default.conf` and disable it."
msgstr ""
"Pokud se místo Zammadu zobrazí výchozí úvodní stránka webového serveru, může "
"být váš `zammad.conf` přebit jiným konfiguračním souborem. Zkontrolujte, zda "
"adresář vhost neobsahuje `000-default.conf` nebo `default.conf`, a takový "
"soubor vypněte."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:312
#, no-wrap
msgid "DNS not resolving"
msgstr "DNS se nepřekládá"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:318
msgid ""
"If the subdomain does not resolve, double-check the DNS records for your "
"domain and wait for them to propagate. Replace the `zammad.example.com` in "
"the following command with your configured domain of Zammad and check if the "
"domain points to the right server:"
msgstr ""
"Pokud se subdoména nepřekládá, zkontrolujte DNS záznamy své domény a "
"počkejte, až se rozšíří. V následujícím příkazu nahraďte "
"`zammad.example.com` nakonfigurovanou doménou Zammadu a ověřte, že doména "
"směřuje na správný server:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:319
#, no-wrap
msgid "host zammad.example.com\n"
